<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Rohingya Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Asab okkolor ham</para>
  <para style="toc3">Asb</para>
  <para style="toc2">Asab</para>
  <para style="toc1">Asab okkolor ham</para>
  <para style="mt">Asab okkolor ham</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Pak Ruhur wada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1"/>Adoijja Teofilos, ãr foila siyarat ãi beggun hin okkolor babute leikki, zin Isaye goijje edde šikka diye, hibaye šuru goijjede hiya loti <verse eid="ACT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2"/>hedin foijjonto zẽtte hibare behostot tuli loiza oiye. Hẽtte hibaye hibar basai goijja asab okkolore Pak Ruhur duwara hokum dil. <verse eid="ACT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>Hibaye toziya bordaš gori bade ei manuš okkolore deha diye edde hiba ze zinda ase hiyanor beša besi biššaš lagede saf forman okkol diye. Sališ din dori hitarare deha diye edde Allar raijjor babute bout hota okkol hoiye. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Ek bar hibaye hitarar fũwati hána háil, hen šomot hitarare endilla hokum diye: <char style="wj">"Tũwara Zeruzalem sari no zaiyogoi, kintu Bafor wada gora ze hadiyar hota tũwara ãttu fuinno hiyanolla entezar goijjo.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/><char style="wj">Kiyollahoile Yahyaye fani loi torikotor gusol diye, kintu ho ek dinor butore tũwara he Pak Ruhur torikotor gusol faiba."</char><verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isare asmanot tuli loi za oiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Sahabi okkole ekku fũwati dola oiyore Isare fusar goredde: "Malik, õne ki ei šomot Israili okkolor hatot raijjo firai diba?"<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Isaye zuwabe hodde: <char style="wj">"Ze din otóba ṭaim zin Bafe nizor odiharor butore raikke, hin tũwarare zanito diya no o.</char> <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/><char style="wj">Kintu he Pak Ruh tũwarar uwore aile tũwara šokti faiba. Ar Zeruzalem, Ehudiya beggulla, Sameriya edde duniyair šeš mata foijjonto tũwara ãr goba oiba." </char><verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Ei hota hoi bade, Isare tuli loi za odde hitara sai taikke. Ar ekkan miyulaye hibare hitarar sukor arguwale gori felaiye.<verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Hitara asmanor mikka ek diyane sai roiye hen šomot, dóla hoor finda duizon manuš hitarar hãse ai tiyaiyegai. <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>Ar hitarare hodde: "Oh Galilor manuš okkol! Tuwara eṛe tiyai asmanor uzu kiyolla sai roiyo? Ei Isa zare tũwarar hãsottu behostot tuli loi za oiyede deikko, ode ode hendilla gori hiba abar uwafes firi aibo."<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Tarfore Sahabi okkol Zaitun faharottu uwafes Zeruzalem firi giyegoi. He faharguwa Zeruzalemottu onumanik ada mailor fõt. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Šohoror butore hitara zeṛe takito, he góror uworor ṭalat giye. Hitara aššilde Fitor, Yahya, Yakub, Andreas, Filip, Ṭomas, Bartolomeus, Moti, Alfeyusor fuwa Yakub, Bahadur Simon Zelot, edde Yakubor fuwa Ehudah. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Itara hoekzon mayafuwain edde Isar ma Moriyam ar Isar báiyain okkolor fũwati hamiša beggune ekmone duwa gorat roiye.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Hẽtte ek bar onumanik ekšo kuri zon torikotor bái bondu okkolor maze tiyai, <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>Fitore hodde: "Oh ãr báiboinain okkol, Ehudar babute Pak Ruhuye nobi Daudor muke zendilla hoil, Pak kalamor he hota hameka furon owa foijje. Isare zara doijje hitarare ei Ehudaye fõt dehaiye. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Hite ãrar butoror ekzon aššil edde ei ekkui šeba hamor bag fail."<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>(Hite kuham gori ze beton faiye hin loi ekkan zobin kinne. Kintu hite mata hemmika abostat meṛit foijje, hitar feṭ faṛi ãti zula niyoli giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Zeruzalemor hár mainše ei hota zani faijjil. Hetolla hitarar zubanot he zobinganore Hokkoldama mani Louwor Zobin name foriso.)<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>"Kiyollahoile Zobur Šorifot leka ase:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">"'Hitar bošot bari hali takok,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">heṛe honokiye bošoti no gorok,'</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Edde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">"'Hitar hamor bar oinno honokiye lok.'<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>Malik Isa ãrar fũwati solafira goijjilde hiya ãrar fũwati hamiša hozon manuš aššil, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>Ebbe šuruttu loti, zẽtte Isaye Yahyattu torikotor gusol loil hiya loti šuru gori hibare ãrar hãsottu behostot tuli loiza oiye foijjonto. Ehon, ei manuš okkolor butottu ekzon ãrar fũwati Isar uwafes zindar babute goba doya owa foribo."<verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Toi hitara dui zonore tiya goraiye, Yusuf zare Barsabbas ba Yustus hoi ḍakito edde Motottiyas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Tarfore hitara duwa goijje: "Oh, Malik, tũi har zonor dilore zano. Ãrare dehai do ei dui zonor butottu zare basona goijjo, <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>šeba edde asabor tokka loibolla, ziyan Ehudaye eri di ze ze laikka heṛe giyegoi." <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Tarfore hitara loṭari maijje edde Motottiyasor name loṭari uiṭṭe. Henot hite o he egarozon asabor fũwati zug diye.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Sahabi okkole Pak Ruh faiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Fõnzaš dinna idor din sahabi okkol beggune ek zagat dola oiye. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Hetunot atikka asmanottu bári boyaror abazor ḍoilla ek abaz aišše edde ze górot hitara boiššil hiyanor hár mikka he abaze furaigiyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Toi hitara dekedde, hinore saite oinor zil okkolor ḍoil, zin šiṛiyore hitara fottizonor uwore boišše. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Henot hitara beggune Pak Ruhuye furaiya oiye edde Ruhuye zare zendilla hota hoibar šokti diye he mozin hitara oinno oinno zuban okkolot hota howa šuru goijje.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Hẽtte Allar ḍorwala Ihudi okkol duniyair har zatittu ai Zeruzalemot bošobaš goijjil. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Ar hitara ei abaz funiyore ek dol manuš zoma oiye edde hitara beggune giyan hara oigiyoi, kiyollahoile hitara fotti ekzonor nizor zubanot hota howa odde fuinne. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Hitara kub beši ammuwak edde tajjuf oiyore fusar goredde: "So, hota hodde itara beggun ki Galilor manuš no neki? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>To ãra kene fottikiyor nizor nizor madinna zuban hodde funir? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Fartiyo, Madiyo edde Elamiyo, edde Mesofotamiyar bašinda okkol, Ehudiya edde Kafnadkiya, Pontus edde Ešia, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Forugiya edde Famfuliya, Mišor edde Leviya deš šoho Kuronir ate hãsor elehar bašinda okkol edde boidešitta Romiyo, <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Ihudi edde Ihudi dórmo manoya manuš okkol edde Kreṭiyo edde Arabiyo manuš okkol ze ãra, ãra ze zar zar zubanot hitara Allar ḍõr ḍõr hamor hota hodde funir!" <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Endilla gori hitara beggune tajjuf oiye. Ar hitara suhara oiyore ekzonore ekzone fusar gora šuru goijje, "Iyanor mani ki?"<verse eid="ACT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Abar hodune hitarare loi ṭaṭṭa urar edde hodde, "Hitara taza šoraf beši fifelaiyore fool oiyede."<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fitoror boyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Kintu Fitore he egarozon sahabir fũwati tiyaiyore he manušor dolore guzori hodde: "Oh Ihudi manuš okkol edde Zeruzalemor bašinda okkol! Tũwara beggune ei hota zani rako edde ãr hota funo! <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Tũwara ziyan mone goror hiyan no, itara šoraf hái fool oiyede no, kiyollahoile aizo binna nowa baijjede! <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Kintu iyan oilde he goṭona ze hota Zuel nobir duwara howa oiye:<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>"'Šeš hale endilla oibo, Allaye hor,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">har mainšor uwore ãi ãr Ruhure ḍali diyum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Tũwarar futziyainde nobi hisabe agam hota hoibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">He zuwan okkole deha faibo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">ar he burá okkole šoppon dekibo.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>En ki, ãr gulam edde bandi okkolor uwore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">he din okkolot ãi ãr Ruh ḍali diyum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ar hitara nobi hisabe agam hota hoibo.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Ãi uwore asmanot nanan keramotor alamot</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">ar nise duniyait nanan ḍoilla sinno,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">lou, oin ar dũwa dehaiyum.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Malikor he moha mohimar din aibar age,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">beil andar oi zaiboi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">san louwor ḍoilla oi zaiboi,<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Ar ze honokiye Malikor nam ḍake,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:21">hite uddar faibo.'<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>"Oh Israili manuš okkol, ei hotagun funo: Nasarator Isaye kuduruti ham, keramot, ar sinno okkolor duwara tũwarar hãse hiba ekzon Allar torfottu formanwala manuš. Isar duwara Allaye tũwarar maze ei ham okkol goijje, zin tũwara nize nize zano. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Allah, ze age loti zane edde faisala gori rakkil, he mozin hibare tũwarar hatot šebi diya oiye. Ar tũwara hibare bedormiyo okkolor hatot tuli di kurušot di mari felaiyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Kintu Allaye hibare moron zontronar hatottu uddar gori tuli loi giyegoi, kiyollahoile hibare moute dori rakibolla šaiddo no aššil. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Badša Daude hibar babute hor:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">"'Ãi Malikore hamiša ãr sarme deki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">kiyollahoile hiba ãr ḍen ḍakottu ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">zene ãi bifodot no fori.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Hetolla ãr dil kuši o, edde ãr zile kušir hota ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ar ãr gagan o aša loi basibo.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Kiyollahoile tũi ãr foranore fatalfurot raki no zaibagoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">No diba tũi, tũwar Paki zonor gare fõsito.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Tũi ãre sinaiyo, zibon fõtore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">tũwar hazirir duwara ãre kušiye furon gore.'<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>"Báiyain okkol, he raz bongšor baf Daudor babute ãi tũwarare kula zubane hoi fariyum, ze hiba morigiyegoi edde hibare dohon gora oiye, ar hibar hobor aizo foijjonto ãrar hãse ase. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Bala, hiba ekzon nobi aššil ar hibaye zanito ze Allaye hosom hái son goijje, <char style="qt">Daudor ekzon bongšodorore hibar šingašonot buwaibo.</char> <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Hetolla Daude agottu loti dekkil buli Isa Mosir uwafes zinda uṛar babute hoiye ze hibare fatalfurot feli raka no o, hibar ga o no fõse. <verse eid="ACT 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Ehon! Ei Isare Allaye morattu uwafes tuille, ar ãra beggun iyanor goba. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Allar ḍen ḍakottu boibar ijjot hibare diya oiye edde hibaye wada gora Pak Ruhure hibar Bafottu faiye, ar ehon tũwara zin dekor edde funor hin oilde he Pak Ruh zin Isaye ḍali diye. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34"/>Daud hono behostot no za, kintu hibaye nize ei hota hoiye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">"'Mabude ãr malikore hodde:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">"Tui ãr ḍen ḍakottu boi,<verse eid="ACT 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35"/>zetodin ãi tor dušmon okkolore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">tor fottole no raki."'<verse eid="ACT 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>"Etolla Israilor hár mainše haṭi gori zanok: Zare tũwara kurušot marifelaila, Allaye he Isare Malik edde Mosi duni ḍoilla goijje."<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tin hazar manuš dola oiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Ei hota funone hitarar dilot tir góillefan oiye. Ar hitara Fitorore edde oinno asab okkolore hodde, "Báiyain okkol, ãrattu ki gora foribo?"<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Fitore zuwabe hodde, "Tũwara fotti ekzone gunattu mon firao edde Isa Mosir name torikotor gusol lo, toi tũwara guna maf faiba, ar hadiya hisabe tũwara Pak Ruhure faiba. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Kiyollahoile tũwaralla edde tũwarar futziyain okkololla edde zara dure ase hitara beggunolla, zar mani zedun manušore ãrar Allah Malike ḍaki anibo hitara beggunolla ei wada gora oiye."<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Hin bade o aro bout hota hoi Fitore goba diye, edde hitarare endilla nosiyot goijje: "Ei zobanar naforman, horaf manuš okkolottu tũwara nizore dure raikko." <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Henot hitara zara Fitoror hota mani loiye, hitara torikotor gusol loiye edde henot hedin hom beši tin hazar manušore Allaye hitarar ekku fũwati zug goijje.<verse eid="ACT 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biššaši okkolor solafira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Ar hitara sahabi okkolor šikka lowat, edde hitarar fũwati šongo diyat, ruṭi bangat edde munazat gorat fori taito. <verse eid="ACT 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Toi beggunor dilot Allar ḍor góille, kiyollahoile sahabi okkole bout tajjuiffa alamot edde sinnor ham okkol goitto. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Ar biššaši okkol beggune ekku fũwati takito edde hár kissu ek taillatt rakito. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Ar hitarar zaga zobin edde šombotti za kissu aššil hin besi zar zendilla zorulot oito he mozin beggunore baṛi diya oito. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Hitara fotti din dórmogóror uṛanot ekku fũwati dola oito, ar gór okkolot hitara hãši kušiye edde šorol mone há fiya gorito. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Hitara Allar tarif gorat taito edde hár mainše hitarare ijjot goitto. Ar zara din din uddar faito, Malike hitarare o ani itarar dolot zug gorito.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Fodaši ãturore aram goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Ekdin dinor tinnwa baze munazator ṭaimot Fitor edde Yuhanna dórmogórot gil. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Heṛe mar feṛottu loti ãtur ekzon manušore hodun manuše bar gori ani dórmogóror šundor name dorozar hãse fotti din buwai dito, zene zara dórmogórot gole hitarattu hite horat sai fare. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Fitor edde Yuhanna dórmogórot goledde dekiyore he manušwaye hitarattu horat saiye. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Henot Fitore edde Yuhannaye šuza hitar mikka saiye. Bade Fitore hodde: "Ãrar mikka sa!" <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Toi manušwaye hitarar hãsottu kissu faibar aša loi hitarar mikka sai roiye.<verse eid="ACT 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Toi Fitore hodde, "Rufa ba šuna ãttu nai, kintu za ase hin tore diyum: Nasarator Isa Mosir name uṛi tiya edde aṭ." <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Bade Fitore hitar ḍen hat sai dori hitare tuille, henot hehon hitar ṭeng edde formuri sokto oiye. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Hite faldi uṛi ṭengor fatar uwore tiyaiye edde aṛa šuru goijje. Toi hite faldi faldi ãṛat maze Allare šukuriya guzar gori gori hitarar fũwati dórmogóror uṛanot giye. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Har mainše zehon hite aṛi faredde edde Allar tarif goredde deikke, <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>hẽtte hitara hitare sini faijje ze hite he manuš, ze dórmogóror šundor name dorozat boi horat magito. Ar hitar uwore ze hanḍo goiṭṭe hin deki hitara beša beši tajjuf edde ammuwak oiye.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>He horat magoyawaye kintu Fitor edde Yuhannar fisa no sare. Fitoror he hamot hár manuš okkol tajjuf oiyore Soloimanor haissarar tole hitarare giri doijje. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Hetunot Fitore hodde: "Israili okkol! Tũwara iyanot tajjuf kiyolla or? Ãrar nizor šoktiye otóba Allare ḍorai de he gunor zoriya itare ãṛi faribolla šokti diyi mone gori kiyolla tũwara ãrar uzu sai taikko? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>No, Ibrahim edde Isak edde Yakubor Allah, ãrar baf dadar Allaye ei hamor duwara hibar nizor gulam Isar mohima forhaš goijje. Tũwara to Isare mari felaibolla dori dila. Filate hibare eri dito sail, kintu tũwara Filator muntu hibare ošikar goijjo. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Tũwara he Fobitro edde Niyaiwalare ošikar gori ekzon kuni manušore tũwaralla eri dito hoiyo. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Ze zibon doya hibare tũwara mari felaila, kintu Allaye hibare zinda gori tuille, hiyanor goba ãra. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Ei manuš iba zare tũwara dekor edde zare tũwara sino, hite Isar namor gune he šokti hamaiye. Isar butottu di ze biššaš ãra fai hiyane ei manušware furafuri bafe aram goijje, zendilla tũwara beggune dekor.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>"Ehon báiyain okkol, ãi zani tũwara tũwarar neta okkolor ḍoil no buziyore Isare kurušor uwore mari felaiyo. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Kintu Allaye hibar Mosiye ze duk šoibo he hota ei bafe furon goijje, ziyan hibaye bout age har nobi okkolor duwara howabail. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Hetolla, tũwara mon firo, toi tũwarar guna fũsi fela oibo. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Ar he Mosi zare tũwaralla basona gora oiye mani Isa, hibare defeṛaiyore tũwarare tottaza gori tuli fare. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Allaye hár kissure abar agor ḍoilla uwafes firai anibode hibar he ṭaim nuwaiye foijjonto hibattu behostot taka foribo, zendilla hibaye bout age hibar nobi okkolor muke hoil. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Musaye to hoiye, 'Mabud Allaye tũwaralla ãr ḍoilla ekzon nobi tũwarar nizor zatir butottu tulibo. Har kissu zin tũwarare hibaye ho hin beggun funa foribo. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Ze hibar hota no funibo hitare hibar mainšor butottu furafuri bafe fũsi fela oibo.'<verse eid="ACT 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>"Hin bade o, nobi Samuelottu loti šuru gori har nobi okkol zara kalam hoi giye hitara o ei din okkolot zin goṭer hinor babute hoi giye. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Ar tũwara to he nobi okkolor bongšor manuš edde he wadar suktir šiyardar, ziyan Allaye tũwarar bafdada okkol loi goijjil, hẽtte Allaye Ibrahimore hoil, 'Tor bongšor butottu di duniyair har zatiye rahamot faibo.' <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Allaye hibar gulam Isare tũwarar sarme tiya goraiye foila, hibare defeṛaiye, ze kufõtottu firi aiye hitare rahamot goribolla."<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Fitor edde Yuhannare ḍõr šobar sarme ana oiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Hitara ehono mainšor loi hota howat ase, hen šomot imam okkol edde dórmogór sõloya okkolor boro edde Sadduki okkol aišše. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Fitor edde Yuhannaye manuš okkolore šikka dedde edde Isar duwara mora okkol abar uwafes uṛar babute tobolig goredde deki hitara beši gušša oiye. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Hitara Fitor edde Yuhannare doijje. He din hãzinna oi giyegoi buli tarforor din foijjonto hitarare ziyolot bon gori raikke. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Kintu hitara zara Fitoror boyan fuinne hitara boute biššaš ainne, henot biššaši furuš manuš okkolor dol barizaiyore hom beši fãs hazar oiye.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Ihudi okkolor neta okkol, murubbi okkol, edde alem okkol ekku fũwati Zeruzalem dola oiye. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>He ḍõr imam Annas o heṛe hazir aššil, ar Kaifas, Yuhanna edde Alekzendar, edde he ḍõr imamor góror oinno manuš okkol o heṛe aššil. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Hitara Fitor edde Yuhannare hitarar sarmottu tiya goraiyore fusar goijje: "Tũwara kiyor šokti loi otóba har nam loi ei ham goijjo?"<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Hetunot Fitore Pak Ruhuye furaiya oiyore hitarare hodde: "Ãrar neta okkol, murubbi okkol! <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>Ekzon ãtur manušore balai goijji buli zehon aijja ãrare zera gora or edde ei manušwa kengori bala oiye, he babute fusar gora or. <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>Henoile tũwara beggune edde har Israil zatiye, ei hota zani rako: Iyan Nasarator Isa Mosi loi, zare tũwara kurušor uwore mari felaila edde zare Allaye mora okkolor butottu tuille, hibar šokti loi ei manušwa furafuri bafe aram oiyore õnorar sarme tiyai roiye. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>Hiba oilde</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">"'he fattor, zibare tũwara raz mistiri okkole bad diyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">kintu hiba i har beggunottuwaro dorhari fattor oiye.'<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Uddar ar honokiyor hãse fa no za, kiyollahoile asmanor nise manušor butore en ar hono nam diya no o, ze namor zoriya ãra uddar oi fari."<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Hitara Fitor edde Yuhannar himmot deikke, ar itara ze anfora edde awam manuš hiyan dekiyore hitara tajjuf oiye, ar itara ze Isar fũwati aššil hiyan buzi faijje. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Aram oiyede manušwa, Fitor edde Yuhannar fũwati tiyat ase, dekiyore hitara itarar berudde hoibar ar kissu no aššil. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Etolla hitarare bisar šobattu bare zaibolla hokum diye edde hitara ekku fũwati biyasanat boišše. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>Hitara hodde: "Ãra ei manuš okkolore loi ken goriyum? Zeruzalemot asede har kiye zane ze itara ekkan ḍõr keramoti ham goijje, ar hiyan ãra ošikar gori no fariyum. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Kintu iyan aro mainšor hãse sorai zai no farefan ei manuš okkolore domki diya foribo, toi zene itara ar honokiyore ei namor babute hono hota no ho."<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Tarfore hitara Fitor edde Yuhannare abar butore ḍaki aniyore hokum diye, zene hitara Isar name hono hota no ho otóba šikka ebbere no de. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Fitor edde Yuhannaye zuwabe hodde: "Tũwarar hokum falon goijjum ne naki Allar hokum falon goijjum? Allar nozorot honnan ṭik, tũwara hiyan bisar gori so! <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Kiyollahoile ãra zin dekki edde fuinni hinor babute no hoi tai no faijjum."<verse eid="ACT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Toi hitarare aro sokto gori domki diyore eri diye. Kiyollahoile hitara itarare šaza dibolla hono ufai tuwai no fa, haron zin goṭṭil hinolla hár manuš okkole Allare tarif goijjil. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Ze manušware keramotir duwara aram gora oiye hitar umor sališ bosorottuwaro beši.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar sahabi okkolor munazat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Hitara hentu sara fai bade, hitarar nizor manuš okkolor hãse giye, ar ḍõr imam edde murubbi okkole zin zin hoil har kissu hitarare zanaiye. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Ei hota funiyore hitara beggune mili ek diyane Allar mutallek munazat gori hodde: "Oh Malik, tũi asman zobin, doriya, hinor butore ze kissu ase beggun sirišti goijjo. <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>Tũi Pak Ruhur duwara tũwar gulam ãrar fordada Daudor muk diyore howaila:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">"'Har zatir manuš okkole kiyolla suhara oi sesamesi gorer?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Kiyolla manuš okkole hannak misa misi Allar berudde zar?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Duniyair badša okkole Mabud edde hibar Mosir berudde tiyaiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">ar šašon goroya okkole ekkui fũwati oiye.'<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>Hendilla ode ode oiye, tũwar Paki gulam Isa, zare tũi Mosi hisabe basona goijjila, badša Herud edde Pontus Filate, ei šohorot hibar berudde Oihudi okkolor fũwati edde Israili okkolor fũwati hat milail. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Tũwar kuduruti edde issa mozin zin zin goṭibode tũi age loti ṭik gori rakkila, hitara hendilla goijje. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Ar ehon Mabud, itara ãrare ki bafe ḍor lagar tũi kiyal goror. Tũwar gulam okkolore endilla šokti do zene kub himmot loi hitara tũwar kalam hoi fare. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Tũwar hat barai do, zene tũwar Paki gulam Isar name hitara manuš okkolore aram gori fare edde keramot edde sinnor ham okkol gori fare."<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Ze zagat hitara dola oiye, munazat gori bade he zagagan hafi uiṭṭe. Ar hitara beggune Pak Ruhuye furaiya oi fũwati šahoš loi Allar kalam howa šuru goijje.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biššaši okkolor muhabbot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Har biššaši okkol beggunor mon dil ek aššil. Hitarar nizor dón šombottire nizor hoi dabi no gorito, kintu hitarattu zin aššil hinore beggun loi borat gorito. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Asab okkole ḍõr šokti loi goba diya šuru goijje ze Isa morattu zinda uṛi giyegoi, ar hitara beggunor uwore Allar ofurani rahamot aššil. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Hitarattu hono obafi manuš nuaššil, kiyollahoile zarattu zobin otóba gór aššil hitara hin okkol besi ṭĩya foiša anito, <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>edde asab okkolor ṭengor ḍake rakito. Bade zattu zendilla zorulot he bafe hitare diya oito.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Yusuf, Kiprus ḍiyar ekzon Levi. Hitare asab okkole Barnabas hoito, zar mani tuwajjo doyar fut. <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Hitattu ekkan zobin aššil, hite hiyan besi ṭĩya ani asab okkolor ṭengor ḍake rakkil.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ananiyas edde Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Ehon, Ananiyas name ekzon manuš edde hitar bou Safiraye ekkan zobin šombotti beisse. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Hite ṭiyattu hodun nizolla raki diyore baki ṭiyagun asab okkolor ṭengor ḍake raikkegoi, ar hite hen goijjede hitar bouwe o furafuri zanito. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Hetunot Fitore hodde, "Ananiyas, Šoitane tor mon kengori dokol goijje, ziyanor zoriya tui Pak Ruhur hãse misa hota hoiyos edde zobin besa ṭiyattu hodun nizolla raki diyos? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Besibar age ki zobingan tor nu aššil ne? Ar besi bade o ki ṭiyagun tor hatot nu aššil ne? To kiyolla tui endilla ham goribi ṭik goijjos? Tui šude mainšor loi misa no hos, kintu Allar loi misa hoiyos."<verse eid="ACT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Ei hota funi mottor Ananiyas meṛit fori mori giyegoi. Ei goṭonar hota zara fuinne hitara beggune beša beši ḍoraiye. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Bade hozon zuwan manuš aišše edde hitar gat kafonor hor berai diye edde bare loi zai hitare dohon gorai felaiye.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Iyar tin gonḍa bade Ananiyasor bou heṛe aišše, kintu ki oiye hin hibaye no zanito. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Fitore hibare fusar goredde, "Sai ho sai, tũwara zobin besiyore beggun failade in ne ki?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Hibaye hodde, "Oi hin beggun in."<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Hetunot Fitore hodde, "Tũwara kengori Mabudor Ruhure entehan goribolla razi oila? Sa, ze mainše tor zamaire dohon goraito aišše hitara dorozar hãsat aišše, ar hitara tore o baire loizaibo."<verse eid="ACT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Safira hetunot Fitoror ṭengor ḍake mori giyegoi. Ar he zuwan manuš okkole butore aiyore dekedde hiba mora, toi hibare baire loizai hibar zamair ḍakottu dohon goraiye. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Hetunot zomator manuš edde oinno zara he hota fuinne hitara beggune beši ḍoraiye.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sinno edde keramot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Asab okkolor duwara bout ḍoilla keramot edde sinnor ham okkol mainšor maze gora oiye. Ar biššaši okkol beggune dórmogóror Soloimanor haissarat ekku fũwati dola oito. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Oinno hono mainše hitarar loi dola oibolla himmot no gorito, zodi o hitarare manuš okkole kub beši ijjot gorito. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Ar din din bout furuš edde mayafuwain okkol Malikor uwore biššaš ainne edde Malikor dolor fũwati zug goijje. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Ar manuš okkole biyaraimma okkolore rastar uwore bar gori ani haṭor uwore edde faṛir uwore neṛai rakito, zene rasta bai zaibar šomot ebbe no oile Fitoror sabagan oile hitarar hono hono kiyor uwore fore. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Zeruzalemor atehasor fara okkolottu bout manuš okkole hitarar biyaraimma okkolore edde horaf zine faiyede manuš okkolore bar gori anito edde hitara beggune aram oito.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isar sahabi okkolor uwore zulum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Hetunot ḍõr imam edde hitar har sãti okkol, zara Sadduki dolor manuš, hitara riše zoli uiṭṭe. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Hitara asab okkolore dori šorkari ziyolot diye. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Kintu raitta Mabudor ekzon firistaye ziyolor dorozagun kuli hitarare hentu baire niyalai ani hodde, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>"Zo, tũwara dórmogóror uṛanot tiyaiore manuš okkolore ei noya zibonor babute har hóbor hogoi."<verse eid="ACT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Ei hota funiyore tarfore binna kub sore hitara dórmogórot giye edde šikka diya šuru goijje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Toi heṛe maze, ḍõr imam edde hitar fũwajja okkol, zara Sadduki dol, mani Israili okkolor murubbi neta beggunore loi ek ḍõr bisar muzoliš ḍaikke edde asab okkolore anibolla hoekzon manušore ziyolot defeṛaiye. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Kintu zehon faharadar okkol heṛe aišše, heṛe hitarare no fa. Hitara uwafes firi zaiyore ei hóbor hoiyegoi, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>"Ãra ziyolor doroza mojbut gori ṭala lagaiya asede edde doroza doroza faharadar okkol tiyai roiyede lot faiyi, kintu doroza kuli honokiyore butore no dekilam." <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Ei hota funi dórmogór sõloya garḍ okkolor boro edde ḍõr imam okkol suhara oi bafa šuru goijje, iyanor anzam ki oibo,hoi.<verse eid="ACT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Hetunot ekzon manuš aiyore hodde, "So, ze manuš okkolore tũwara ziyolot dila hitara dórmogóror uṛanot tiyaiyore mainšore šikka der." <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Hetunot faharadar okkolor boroye hitar manuš okkol loi zaiyore hitarare dori ainne. Kintu mainše fattor maribo ḍore hitara asab okkolor uwore hono zobodusti no gore.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Hitara asab okkolore aniyore bisar šobar sarme tiya goraiye. Hetunot ḍõr imame asab okkolore hodde: <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>"Ãra tũwarare hora bafe hokum dilam he namor babute šikka no dibolla, kintu tũwara tũwarar šikkare Zeruzalemor aga gura borai felaiyo, edde he manušwar louwor dai ãrare goitto sor."<verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Hetunot Fitor edde oinno asab okkole zuwab dedde: "Manušor hokum falon goribattuwaro bolke Allar hokum ãra falon goronnan zoruri! <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Zare õnora ek gasor uwore ṭaikko edde mari felaiyo, ãrar baf dadar Allaye he Isare morattu uwafes tuille. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Allaye hibare badša edde Basailoya hisabe hibar ḍen ḍakottu boibar ijjot diye, zene hibaye Israili okkolore gunattu mon firat ani fare edde gunar maf di fare. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Ãra in beggunor babute goba, ar zara Allar baiddo o, hitarare Allaye he Pak Ruhure diye, he Pak Ruh o hibar goba."<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Ei hota funi hitara guššaye oin oiye edde hitarare furai felaibolla ereda loiye. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Kintu he bisar šobattu Gamaliel name ekzon Foroši alem, zare hár mainše ijjot goitto, hiba tiyai giyegoi edde ei manuššunore hotun baire loizai raka oibolla hokum diye. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Tarfore hibaye ḍõr šobare hodde: "Israili okkol! Tũwara ei manuššunore kissu goribar age bala gori bafi so. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Oto! kissu din age Tevdas name ekzon manuš muntu aišše, hitare hite ekzon ḍõr manuš dabi goijjil, ar hom beši sair šot mainše hitar fũwati zug dil. Hitare mari fela oiye edde hitar har sãti okkol šiṛašitta oi giyegoi edde hãzi giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Hite bade, manuš gona oibar šomot endilla oilo, Galilot Ehudaye ek dol manušore failo, kintu hite o mori giyegoi, ar hitar sãti okkol beggun šiṛašiṭṭa oi giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Hetolla ãi tũwarare hoir: Ei manuš okkolore kissu no goijjo. Itarare sari do, kiyollahoile itarar moksud edde haz harbar zodi manušor torfottu oi take, toile hin dongšo oi zaiboi. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Kintu zodi Allar torfottu o, toile tũwara itarare tamai no fariba. Hetolla hũšiyar! Ar no oile šude dekiba, tũwara Allar berudde larai goror."<verse eid="ACT 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Toi hitara hibar mošowarat razi oiye. Hitara asab okkolore abar butore ḍaki ainne edde hitarare bet marabaiye. Tarfore hitarare Isar nam loi tobolig no goribolla hokum diyore bade eri diye.<verse eid="ACT 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Henot Isar namolla buli asab okkole ze ohomani oibar laikka oiye, hiyanolla kuši gori gori hitara he bisar šobattu giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Hitara fotti din dórmogórot edde góre góre zai šikka diye, hitara hinore tiya gorai no fele, Isa ze Mosi he kušir hóbor tobolig gorat aššil.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Hãtzonore basona goijje</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Ar he ṭaimot, zehon biššaši okkol bari uṛa šuru goijje, hitarar butore Girik baša hoiya okkole Ibroni baša hoiya okkolore endilla hoi hosuri diya šuru goijje, ze fotti din hána dibar šomot hitarar rari mayafuwain okkole kissu no fa. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Henot maze he barozon asabe har biššaši okkolore ek zagat ḍakiyore hodde: "Ãra Allar kalam tobolig gora bad gori hána diyar befar loi fori taka, iyan ãralla ṭik no. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Kintu oh báiyain okkol tũwara tũwarar butore zarar bala nam ase edde zara Pak Ruhuye furaiya edde giyani manuš hendilla hãt zonore basi lo. Hitarare ãra ei hamor bar diyum. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Kintu ãra munazat edde kalam toboligot diyan diyum."<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Ei mošowarare dolor beggune bala gori goisse edde hitara biššaš edde Pak Ruhuye boron botti Stifanore, bade Filip, Frokorus, Nikanor, Timon, Farmenas, edde Anṭiyok šohoror Ihudi dórmot zat diya Nikolas, itarare basi loiye. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Bade asab okkolor sarme hitarare tiya goraiye, zara duwa goijje edde hitarar uwore hat raikke.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Toi Allar kalam ei bafe sorai giyegoi edde Zeruzalemot biššaši okkol beša beši bari uṛi gilgoi. Ar ek dol ḍor imam okkolor dole o biššašor baiddota oiye.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Stifan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Stifane Allar rahamot edde šokti furaiya oiyore manuš okkolor butore bout keramot edde sinnor ham okkol goijje. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Ze muzolišhanare azad gora manuš okkolor sinagog hoito, hiyanor hoekzon manuše Stifanor fisali laigge. Hitara aššilde Kuroni edde Alekzanderiya šohor ar Kilikiya edde Ešiar hoekzon Ihudi okkol, hitara Stifan loi hotat bara bari diya šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Kintu Stifane Pak Ruhur duwara kub giyan loi hota hoiye. Hetolla hitara hibar berudde tiyai no fare.<verse eid="ACT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Hetunot he Ihudi okkole gufone hoekzon Ihudire endilla hoibolla uskani diye, "Ãra Stifanore nobi Musa edde Allar berudde kuferi goredde funni."<verse eid="ACT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Endilla gori hitara mainšore, murubbi okkolore edde Alem okkolore hafai tuille. Ar hitara Stifanore dori he ḍõr bisar šobar sarme ainne. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Hitara ho ekzon misa goba tiyagoraiye, hitara hodde, "Ei manušwaye hamiša dórmogóror edde Musar ainor berudde hota ho. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Ãra ite endilla hodde funni ze, he Nasarator Isaye bole ei dórmogór bangi felaibo edde Musaye ze ain okkol ãrare di giye hinore bole bodoli felaibo."<verse eid="ACT 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>He ḍõr bisar šobat boiššilde hitara beggune Stifanor uzu sadde Stifanor siyaragan ek firistar siyarar ḍoil oi giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Toi ḍõr imame Stifanore fusar goijje, "Ei hota ki soiyi ne?"<verse eid="ACT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Zuwabe Stifane hodde: "Oh ãr báiyain edde baf okkol ãr hota funo! Ãrar fordada Ibrahim Harran šohorot bošoti loibar age zẽtte Mesofotemiya dešot aššil, hẽtte fohoraiwala Allaye hibare deha diyore hoil, <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>'Tui tor nizor deš edde tor egena gušti feli ãi tore ze deš dehaiyum heṛe zagoi.'<verse eid="ACT 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>"Toi hiba Kalaḍiya okkolor deš felai Harran šohorot gil edde heṛe bošoti loil. Ar hibar baf mori bade, Allaye Ibrahimore ei dešot defeṛail, zeṛe tũwara ehon bošoti goror. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Allaye hibare nizolla hono zobin no de, enki ekkan ṭeng raki farefan zaga o no, kintu hibaye wada goijjil ze hibare edde hibar bade hibar bongšor manuš okkolore hitarar miraz hisabe he dešore dibo, zodi o he šomot Ibrahimottu hono fuwain no aššil. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Allaye hibare endilla hoil: 'Tor bongšodor okkol bidešot bošobaš goribo. Manuš okkole hitarare gulam banai rakibo edde sair šot bosor dori hitarar uwore zulum salaibo.' <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Allaye aro hodde, 'Kintu ze zatiye hitarare gulam banaibo ãi hitarare šasti diyum. Bade hitara he dešottu niyoli aiyore ei zagat ãr ebadot goribo.' <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Tarfore Allaye Ibrahimore wadar suktir sinno hisabe azomi goraibar niyom dil, bade hiba Isakor baf oiye edde ašṭo dinor din hibare azomi gora oiye. Hendilla Isake Yakubore edde Yakube he baro gušṭir baf okkolore azomi goraiye.<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>"He baro bongšor baf okkole riš gori Yusufore gulam hisabe Mišor dešot besifelail. Kintu Allah hibar fũwati aššil, <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>edde har duk hošṭottu hibare uddar goijje. Allaye hibare giyan dan goijjil edde Mišor dešot razar bala nozorot felabail. Hetolla he razaye hibare Mišor dešor šašon goroya edde razar nizor gór dehafuna goriballa buwail.<verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>"Tarfore Mišor agagura edde Kenanot raṭ deha dilo, edde beši ḍõr hošṭo hazir oiye hetunot ãrar bafdada okkole haiddo lot no fail. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Kintu Mišorot gĩyu ase funi Yakube ãrar bafdada okkolore foila bar heṛe defeṛaiye. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Dusora bar zẽtte hitara aišše Yusufe hibar báiyaindore sin diye edde razaye Yusufor górwala okkolor babute zani faijje. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Iyar bade, Yusufe hibar baf Yakub edde góror gušṭi ṭiya, muṭ hoittor fãszon, beggunore ḍaki anibolla hóbor defeṛaiye. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Tarfore Yakub lami Mišor dešot gil, zeṛe hiba edde ãrar bafdada okkol entehal goijje. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Hitarare Šekimot ana oiye edde ze hoboror gãt Ibrahime Šekim šohoror Hamoror fũwain okkolottu rufa diyore kini loil, hibat dohon gora oil.<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>"Ibrahimor hãse Allaye ze wada goijje hin furon oibar ṭaim zehon hãse aišše, hetunot deha zadde ãrar manušzon okkol kub beši bari giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Tarfore Mišor dešot en 'ekzon noya badša oiye, ze Yusufor babute kissu no zanito.' <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>He badšaye ãrar manuš okkolore ṭokaito edde ãrar bafdada okkolor uwore zulum goitto, enki hitarattu ze futziyain okkol zormo oito hitara mori zagoifan he gura fuwain okkolore baire felai rakibolla zur gorito.<verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>"He šomot Musa zormo oil. Musa Allar šanot ekzon beši šundojja fuwa aššil. Hibare tin maš foijjonto baf mar górot lalon falon gora oil. <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Bade zẽtte hibare baire felai raka oiye, hẽtte razar ziye tuli loizaiyore hibare nizor fuwa hisabe lalon falon goijje. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Mišoriyo okkolor har giyane en bafe šikkita oiye, hiba hotaye edde hame šoktišali aššil.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>"Musar umor sališ bosor oiyede šomot hibaye Israili báiyain okkol loi deha goitto zaibo faisela loil. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Ar heṛe Mišoriyo ekzone hitarar ekzonore horaf bebohar goredde Musaye deikke, toi hibaye ei Israili manušwar foikka oibolla giye edde he Mišoriyo manušware marifelaiyore hiyanor daiya loiye. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Musaye mone gojjil hibar nizor manuš okkole buzibo ze Allaye hibar duwara hitarare uddar goribo, kintu hitara hiyan buzi no fare. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Tarforor din Musaye duizon Israilire mara mari goredde deikke. Hetunot hitarare milai dibolla hodde, 'Oh báiyain, tũwara to bái bái, to kiyolla ekzone ekzon loi endilla horaf bebohar goror?'<verse eid="ACT 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>"Kintu ze manušwaye horaf bebohar goijjil hite Musare ḍeikka mari lorai diyore hodde, 'Ãrar uwore tore šašon goroya edde bisarhar hone tuille? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Gelde hailla zendilla gori he Mišoriyo manušware mari felaiyos, ãre o ki hendilla gori mari felaito sos?' <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Ei hota funi Musa dai zaigoi Midiyan dešot musafer hisabe bošobaš gora šuru goijje. Heṛe hibattu duizon morod fuwain zormo oil.<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>"Sališ bosor farai zaigoi bade, Sinai faharor ḍake bošoti sara elehat maze ek firistaye ek zolonto zaḍḍowar oinor butottu Musare deha diye. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Musaye dekiyore tajjuf oil. Hibaye aro hãse zai saibolla zehon giye, hetunot Mabudor abaz fuinne: <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>'Ãi tor fordada okkolor Allah, Ibrahim, Isak edde Yakubor Allah.' Kintu Musaye ḍore hafa šuru goijje, hikka saibolla o himmot no gore.<verse eid="ACT 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>"Hetunot Mabude hibare hodde, 'Tor ṭengor zuta kulifela, kiyollahoile ze zagat tui tiyaiyos hiyan Paki zaga. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Mišor dešot ãr bonda okkolor uwore ze zulum or hin ãi dekki. Ãi hitarar hatoranir ḍak funni edde hitarare uddar goribolla ãi nise lami aišši. Ehon ãi tore Mišor dešot uwafes defeṛaiyum.'<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>"Iba oilde he Musa zare Israili okkole en hoi batil goijjil, 'Tore šašon goroya edde bisarhar hone banaiye.' Ze firistaye he zaḍḍowar butottu Musare deha dil, he firistar duwara Allah nize ei Musare Israili okkolor šašon goroya edde uddar goroya hisabe Mišorot defeṛail. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Ei Musaye Mišor dešottu Israili okkolore niyolai loi ainnil edde Mišor dešot, louwor doriyar ḍake edde sališ bosorfan bošoti sara elehat bout keramot edde sinnor ham okkol goijjil.<verse eid="ACT 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>"Iba oilde he Musa ze Israili okkolore hoil, 'Allaye tũwarar nizor báiyain okkolor butottu tũwaralla ãr ḍoil ekzon nobi tiya goraibo.' <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Ei Musa bošoti sara elehat maze Israili okkolor dolor butore, ãrar fordada okkolor fũwati aššil. Ze firistaye Sinai faharottu hota hoil ei Musaye he firistar fũwati heṛe aššil. Ãrare dibolla hibaye zinda kalam fail.<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>"Kintu ãrar fordada okkole Musare mainto no sa. Hiyanor bodole hitara hibare batil goijjil edde hitarar dil Mišoror uzu oigilgoi. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Hitara Harunore hodde, 'Ãrare fõt dehai loi zai farefan dev devi banao, kiyollahoile ze Musaye Mišor dešottu ãrare niyolai loi ainne hibar ki oiye ãra hoi no fari. <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>He ṭaimot maze hitara gorur so ḍoil gori uggwa mutti tiyar goijje. Hitara he muttir mutallek zanuwar kurbani goijje edde nizor hate banaiyede hiyanor uwore hitara kušir mela goijje. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Kintu Allaye hitarattu muk firai felaiye edde asmanor san šurzo edde tara fũzat maze hitarare felai raikke, zendilla nobi okkolor kitabot leka ase:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">"'Oh, Israil zati, bošoti sara elehat he sališ bosorfan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">tũwara ki ãr mutallek hono zandar kurbani ba hadiya dila ne?<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>No, no do, bolke tũwara to Mulok devotar mutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">ar Rifon devotar tara, tũwara bar gori boi loi gila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">fũza goribar niyote he mutti okkol banaila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Kintu ãi tũwarare Babilonor okule felai diyum.'<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>"Bošoti sara elehat ãrar fordada okkolottu uggwa ṭambu aššil zibaye Allah hitarar fũwati aššilde forman diye. Allaye Musare zendilla gori hokum dil edde Musare ze nomuna dehail he mozin ei ṭambu tiyar gora oil. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Ãrar fordada okkol he ṭambu faiyore hitarar neta Yosbar anḍare hiyan hitarar fũware ei dešot loi aššil. Allaye hitarar sarmottu oinno zatire lorai dil edde hitara ei deššan adai goijjil. Daudor ṭaim foijjonto he ṭambu ei dešot aššil. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Hibaye Allattu rahamot fail edde ejazot dibolla foriyad goijjil zene Yakubor bongšolla ekkan dórmogór hibaye tiyar gori fare. <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Kintu Soloimane hiballa ekkan dórmogór tiyar goijjil.<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>"Zen oibo ok, šorbo šoktiwala Allah manušor tiyari górot no take, zendilla nobiye hor:<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>"'Behosto oilde ãr šingašon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">ar duniyai ãr ṭeng rakibar zaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ãlla tui hondilla gór tiyar goribi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Mabude hor.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Zaga hiyan hoṛe, zeṛe ãi zirai faijjum?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Ei šob ziniš beggun ki ãi nizor hate foida no gori ne?'<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>"Oh ek gũwaijja zati! Tũwarar han edde dil Oihudi okkolor ḍoil, ar tũwara o tũwarar fordada okkolor ḍoil. Tũwara šob šome Pak Ruhure bad di tako. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>En hono ki nobi ase, zare tũwarar fordada okkole zulum no gore? Hitara hitarare mari felail, zara agottu loti he niyaiwala aibar babute tobolig goijjil. Ar ehon tũwara hibar loi dúha bazi goijjo edde mari felaiyo. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Firista okkolor duwara tũwarar hãse to ain diya oil, kintu tũwara hin falon no goro."<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Stifanore fattor mara oiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Ei hota okkol funi hitara guššaye oin oi giyegoi edde Stifanor berudde dat loi dat kirkiraiye. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Kintu Stifane, Pak Ruhuye furaiya oi behostor mikka sai taikke edde heṛe Allar mohimar deha faiye. Hibaye Isare Allar den ḍakottu tiyai taikkede dekiyore, <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>Stifane hodde, "So, ãi behosto kula asede dekir edde Adomor Fut Allar ḍen ḍakottu tiyai roiye."<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Henot hitara hanot õl diye edde zure guzoriyore beggune Stifanor uwore zafai foijje. <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Bade hitara Stifanore fattor maribolla ṭani šohoror bar kule loigiye, ar goba okkole hitarar zubba okkol gattu kuli Šaulus name ek zuwan fuwar ṭengor ḍake eijje.<verse eid="ACT 7:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Hitara Stifanore fattor maredde šomot, hibaye munazat goijje edde hodde, "Malik Isa, ãr ruhure gosi lo." <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Tarfore hibaye ãṛu felaiye edde ḍõr gori guzojje, "Malik, itarar berudde ei gunare monot no raikko," ei hota hoi hiba zurai giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Saul o Stifanore kun gorat razi aššil.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Zulum</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">He din Zeruzalemot Isayi zomator manuš okkolor uwore beša beši zulum owa šuru oiye. Henot asab okkolgun bade ar har biššaši okkol Ehudiya edde Sameriyar hár zagat šiṛa šitta oi giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Hoekzon allawala manuše Stifanore dohon goraiye edde hiballa kub beši bilag goijje. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Kintu Saule he zomatore dongšo gori felaibar kušišot góre góre zai zomator mayafuwain edde morod fuwain okkolore ṭani ani ani ziyolot diya šuru goijje.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sameriyat Filipor tobolig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Ze biššaši okkol šiṛa šiṭṭa oigilgoi, hitara sairo mikka giye edde kalam tobolig goijje. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>He šomot Filipe Sameriyar ek šohorot zai Mosir babute tobolig goijje. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Ar beggune zara hibar hota fuinne edde ze keramoti ham okkol hibaye goijje, hin saiyore hitara hibar hota mon di fuinne. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Bout kiyor butottu napak ruh okkol sikkar mari niyoli gilgoi edde bout leng biyaraimma edde ãtur okkol aram oiye. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Henot heṛe šohorot ek ḍõr kuši oiye.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>He šohorot Simon name ekzon manuš aššil, ze bout din dori heṛe zadu dehaito, henot Sameriyar manuš okkol ebbere tajjuf oi zaitogoi. Hite hitare ek ḍõr manuš fukarito. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Ar šoṛo ḍõr beggune hitar hotare dam dito edde hoito: "Allar ze kudurutire ḍõr kuduruti howa o, ite he ḍõr kuduruti." <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Mainše hitar hota mozin solito, kiyollahoile bout din dori hite hitar zadu dehaiyore hitarare tajjuf gorat aššil. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Kintu Filipe zehon Allar raijjor babute edde Isa Mosir namor kušir hóbor tobolig goijje hetunot manuš okkole hibar hotat biššaš ainne, Hitara mayafuwain edde morod fuwain beggune torikotor gusol loiye. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>He Simon nize o biššaš ainne, toi hite torikotor gusol loi bade Filipor fũwati fũwati gil, ar sinno edde ḍõr ḍõr keramoti ham okkol deki hite ammuwak oil.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Zeruzalemor asab okkole zehon fuinne, ze Sameriyar manuš okkole Allar kalamor uwore biššaš ainne, hetunot hitara Fitor edde Yuhannare hitarar hãse defeṛaiye. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Hitara heṛe fõsi bade, hitara Pak Ruhure faibolla duwa goijje. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Kiyollahoile hẽtte o hitarar uwore Pak Ruh no aiye. Bolke hitarare šude Isar name torikotor gusol diya oil. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Ehon hitarar uwore hat raikke, ar hitara Pak Ruhure faiye. <verse eid="ACT 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Kintu Simone zehon deikke ze asab okkole hat rakiyore hitarare Pak Ruhure diye, hetunot hite hitarar hãse ṭĩya ainne <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>edde hodde: "Ãre o ei šokti do, zene ãi o honokiyor uwore hat rakile hite he Pak Ruhure fa."<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Hetunot Fitore hitare hodde: "Tor ṭĩya tor fũwati donšo ok, kiyollahoile tui mone goijjos Allar hadiya ṭĩya di kina fa. <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Tottu ei hamot hono miraz otóba bag nai, kiyollahoile tor dil Allar mikka soiyi no. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Ei horafittu tui mon fira edde Mabudor hãse munazat gor. Hen oile Allaye tor dilor ei horaf sinta oitfare maf goribo. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Kiyollahoile ãi dekir, tor dil lalsiye boraiya edde tui gunar hãse kobza oi taikkos."<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Hetunot Simone hodde: "Tũwara Mabudor hãse ãlla duwa goro zene tũwara zen hoiyo hendilla ãr uwore no goṭe."<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Hitara Malikor babute kalam tobolig edde goba diye bade Zeruzalem firi giyegoi. Zargoide fõtot hitara Sameri okkolor bout fara okkolot kušir hóbor tobolig goijje.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Filip edde Etupiar raz hormosari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Ekdin Mabudor ek firistaye Filipore hodde, "Uṭ, doin mikkar rastat za, ze rasta Zeruzalemottu Gaza šohoror mikka giye." He rastawa aššilde bošoti sara elehat. <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Toi Filipe hikka giye edde fõtot Etupia dešor ekzon has raz hormosari loi deha oiye. Etupiar Kandaki ranir dón mal dehafuna goribar bar ei manušwar uwore aššil. Allar ebadot goribolla ei raz hormosariwa Zeruzalem gil, <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>ar ehon górot uwafes firi zargoide fõtot, hite hitar gũra garit boi nobi Esaiyar kitab telewat gorer. <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Pak Ruhuye Filipore hodde, "Oi gũra garir hãse za edde hiyanor hãse takis."<verse eid="ACT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Toi Filipe dũri he gũra garir hãse giye edde funedde manušwaye nobi Esaiyar kitabwa telewat gorer. Filipe fusar goredde, "Tũi telewat gorodde hin buzo ne?"<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>He hormosariye hodde, "Honokiye buzai no dile ãi ken gori buzi fariyum." Hite Filipore gũra garit uiṭṭo edde hitar ḍake boibolla foriyad goijje.<verse eid="ACT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>He raz hormosariwaye zin telewat goijje hin oilde in:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">"Zorgoraibar soolore loizafan gori hibare loigiye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">soolor kẽš ãsoyar munttu zendilla sool suf take,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">hendilla hibaye o muk no kuler.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Hiba ohomani oiye, hibar uwore niyai bisar gora no o.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Hone hoi faribo hibar bongšor hota?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">zehon hibar foran ei duniyaittu loifela oiye."<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>He raz hormosariwaye Filipore hodde, "Meherbani gori ekkena hona, nobiye ei hota har babute hodde, nizor babute ne naki ar oinno honokiyor babute?" <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Toi Filipe Pak kitabor he aiyatottu loti šuru goijje edde Isar kušir hóbor hitar hãse zanaiye.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Hitara fõt bai zaite zaite en ek zagat fõissegoi, zeṛe fani ase. Hetunot he raz hormosariwaye hodde, "So, eṛe fani ase, ãi torikotor gusol loite ãttu banda hoṛe?" <verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>(Filipe hodde, "Tũi zodi zane dile biššaš goro toile tũi loi fariba."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:37">Hetunot he hormosariwaye hodde, "Ãi biššaš gori ze Isa Mosi oilde Allar Fut.") <verse eid="ACT 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Toi he hormosariwaye gũra gari tiya goraito hokum diye. Ar Filip edde raz hormosari, hitara dunizone fanit maze laimme. Toi Filipe hitare torikotor gusol diye. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Hitara fanittu uṛi aiššede šomot, Mabudor Ruhuye Filipore loigiyegoi, raz hormosariwaye hibare ar no deke. Toi hite kuši oiyore hitar nizor baisar uzu giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Filipore kintu Ašdud šohorot deha giye. Ar hibaye har šohor okkolot kušir hóbor tobolig gori gori Sizeriya foijjonto giye.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Damaskusot Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Saule hehono Malikor sahabi okkolor uwore zafai forat roiye edde hitarare zane mari felaibo domki diyat roiye. Saule ḍõr imamor heṛe giye, <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>edde hitattu Damaskus šohoror sinagog okkololla šeṛi saiye, zene Saule he fõtot giyede hendilla nari furuš zarare faibo, hitarare bandi Zeruzalem loi ani fare. <verse eid="ACT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>Hite baisa di Damaskusor hãsa hãsi fõissegoide šomot, asmanottu atikka ek fohoror šoṛak hitar sairo mikka foijje. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Hite meṛit fori giyegoi edde ek abaz fuinne, hodde, <char style="wj">"Saul, Saul, kiyolla tui ãr uwore zulum goror?"</char><verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Saule hodde, "Malik, tũi honnuwa?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Malike hodde, <char style="wj">"Ãi he Isa, zar uwore tui zulum goror.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/><char style="wj">Tui ehon uṛi šohoror butore za, tottu ki gora foribo hin tore heṛe howa oibo."</char><verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Ze manuš okkol Saulor fũwati giye hitara ammuwak oi tiyai roiye, hitara abaz fuinne kintu honokiyore no deke. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Bade Saul uṛi tiyaiye edde suk kuille, kintu hite suke deki no faijjil. Hetunot hitar fũwajja okkole hate dori dori hitare Damaskus šohorot loigiye. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Tin din foijjonto Saul anda oi aššil edde hána fani kissu no há.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Damaskusot Ananiyas name ekzon sahabi aššil. Malike hibare deha diyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Ananiyas!" </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Hibaye hodde, "Malik, so ãi eṛe."<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Toi Malike hibare hodde, <char style="wj">"Uzu name ze rasta ase tui he rastat za, heṛe Ehudar górot Saul hoi ekzon Tarsus šohoror manušore talaš gorgoi, kiyollahoile hite duwa gorer.</char> <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/><char style="wj">Ar hite ek deha faiyede heṛe dekedde, Ananiyas name ekzon manuš aiyore hitar uwore hat rakibo, toi hite abar suke dekibo."</char><verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Kintu Ananiyase hodde, "Malik, ãi bout kiyor mukottu ei manušwar babute fuinni, Zeruzalemot tũwar Paki manuš okkolor uwore ite hondilla zulum okkol goijje. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Ar ehon, hite ḍõr imamottu kemota loi õnor name ḍakede har mainšore bandi loizaibolla eṛe o aiššiye."<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Kintu Ananiyasore Malike hodde,<char style="wj">"Tui za! Kiyollahoile Oihudi edde hitarar badša okkol edde Israili okkolor hãse ãr babute tobolig goribolla ite ãr basona goijja zontro. </char> <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/><char style="wj">Ãi hitare dehaiyum ãr namolla buli hitattu hoto duk šowa foribo."</char><verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Toi Ananiyas giye edde he górot góille, ar Saulor uwore hat rakiyore hodde, "Bái Saul, eṛe aibar fõtot tore ze deha dil he Isaye ãre defeṛaiye, zene tui suke dekibar šokti firai fos edde Pak Ruhuye furaiya os." <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Hetunot Saulor sukottu õišor ḍoilla ekkan ki fori giyegoi, toi hite abar suke deki faijje. Tarfore hite uiṭṭe edde torikotor gusol loiye, <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>tarfore hite hána haiyore doromoro oiye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Saule hoto din Damaskus šohoror biššaši okkolor fũwati heṛe taikke. <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Ar deri no gori hibaye sinagog okkolot tobolig gora šuru goijje, ze Isa oilde Allar Fut. <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Beggune zara hibar hota funito, hitara tajjuf oi fusar gorito, Zeruzalemot zara Isar nam dori ḍakito hitarare zulum goittode, ite no ne ki? Ar eṛe o zara Isar nam dori ḍake hitarare bandi ḍõr imamor hãse loi zaibolla aiššede, ite no ne ki? <verse eid="ACT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Saule kintu lagatar ḍõr ḍõr šokti faiye. Damaskusor Ihudi okkole zuwab dibolla fõt udda tui no fa, zẽtte hibaye Isa Moside forman diye.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Iyar bout din bade Ihudi okkole hibare mari felaibolla felain goijje. <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Kintu Saule hitarar felainor hota zani faijje. Hibare mari felaibolla hitara šohoror geiṭ okkolot dine raite fahara diye. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Kintu ek raitta hibar šagirit okkole hibare ek ḍular butore gori loizai ḍebal far gorai diye.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeruzalemot Saul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Saul Zeruzalem ai bade sahabi okkol loi zug dito saiye, kintu beggune hibare ḍoraiye. Saul ze ekzon hãsa biššaši hiyan hitara biššaš gori no faijjil. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Kintu Barnabase hibare fũwati asab okkolor hãse loigiye edde Saule fõtot ki bafe Malikor deha fail edde ki bafe Malike Saul loi hota hoil, ar ki bafe Saule Damaskusot šahoš loi Isar nam tobolig goijje hin okkol hibaye hitarare zanaiye. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Tarfore oite Saul hitarar fũwati Zeruzalemot takito edde butore baire aša zawa goitto, ar kulasa bafe edde šahoš loi Malikor namot tobolig gorito. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Hibaye Girik baša hoiya Ihudi okkol loi hotabattara edde barabari goitto, kintu hitara hibare mari felaibolla kušiš goijje. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Torikotor báiyain okkole zehon ei hota fuinne, hibare Sizeriya šohorot loi giyegoi, toi hentu Tarsus šohorot faṭai diye.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>He šomot Ehudiya, Galil edde Sameriya eleha okkolor zomat okkolot šanti aššil. He zomatgun gori uṭṭil, hiyanor zoriya Malikor mutallek ḍor edde Pak Ruhur tuwajjo loi solat zomator manuš okkol bari uṭṭil.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fitoror keramot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Fitore hár zagat gurite gurite Ludda šohorot ze Allar bonda okkol aššil hitarar hãse aišše. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Heṛe Aneas name ekzon manušore dekkil, hite aššilde ãtur, ze ašṭo bosor mula bisanat fori roiye. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Fitore hitare dekiyore hodde: "Aneas, Isa Mosiye tore bala gorer. Uṭ, tor bisana tuli lo." Hite hehon uṛi tiyaiye. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Henot Ludda šohorot edde Šarun ḍeilot takitode hár manuš okkole Aneasore deki Malikor mikka fijje.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Zaffa šohorot Tabita name ek mayafuwa biššaši aššil, Girik bašat Dorka (mani Horini). Hibaye beši bala ham okkol edde gorib okkolore modot okkol gorito. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Kintu hẽtte hibattu beši ošuk oiyore bade mori giyegoi, ar manuš okkole hibare duwaiyore uworor uggwa kamerat rakkil. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Ludda aššilde Zaffa šohoror hãsa hãsi, toi sahabi okkole fuinne ze Fitor Luddat ase. Hitara duizon manušore hibar hãse defeṛaiye, hibare hitarar heṛe toratori aito foriyad goribolla hoi. <verse eid="ACT 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Toi Fitor hitarar fũwati giye. Hiba heṛe fõsi bade hibare uworor kamerat loigiye. Heṛe rari okkol beggune Fitorore berai doijje. Dorka basi taite hibaye ze kuruta edde oinno horsuwor silail hin okkolore hitara Fitorore deha šuru goijje edde handa šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Toi Fitore beggunore hentu niyolai diye edde ãṛu felai duwa goijje. Tarfore he mora maya fuwawar uzu firiyore hodde: "Tabita, uṭ! Henot hibaye suk kuille, ar Fitorore deki uṛi boišše." <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Toi Fitore hat diyore hibare tuille. Tarfore biššaši edde rari okkolore ḍaikke edde hibare zinda dehaiye. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Ei hota Zaffa šohoror beggune zani faijje edde boute Malikor uwore biššaš ainne. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Fitor bout din mula Zaffa šohorot Simon name ekzon samorar ham goroyar górot taigilgoi.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Korneliuse Fitorore ḍakito defeṛaiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Sizeriya šohorot Kornelius name ekzon manuš aššil. Hite aššilde Iṭalittu Romiyo šoinno dolor ofisar. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Hite ekzon allawala manuš, hitar góror beggune o Allare ḍoraito. Hite Ihudi gorib okkolore šome šome modot okkol dito, ar Allar hãse hamiša munazat gorito. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Ek din, dinor tinnwa baijjede ṭaimot maze hite ekkan deha faiye. Hite foriškar gori deikke ze Allar ekzon firista aiyore hitare ḍaker: "Kornelius!"<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Korneliuse ḍoraiye edde he firistar mikka saiyore hodde, "Ki hodde, malik?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Firistaye hodde, "Tor munazat edde gorib okkolore modotor hota Allar hãse fõisse edde Allaye hin monot raikke. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Ehon tui Zaffa šohorot manuš defeṛai Simon, zare Fitor o ho, hitare ḍaki an. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Hite Simon name ek samora biyarir górot ase, ze górgan doriyar hãsat."<verse eid="ACT 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Ze firistaye Kornelius loi hota hoil hiba hentu giyegoi, bade Korneliuse duizon gulam edde ekzon nizor faharadari šoinnore ḍaikke. <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>Hite har hota buzaiye edde hitarare Zaffa šohorot defeṛaiye.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Tarforor din he manuš okkol fõt bai zaite zaite zẽtte Zaffa šohoror hãsa hãsi fõissegai, hẽtte ṭaim onumanik dũijja, Fitore sador uwore munazat goribolla uṭṭil. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Hibattu bug laigge edde kissu haito saiye, kintu hitara hehono hána tiyar gorat aššil, hetunot Fitor zurainna mikka abostat aššil. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>He abostat maze Fitore dekedde asman kuli giyegoi edde hono kissu ekkan lami aiyer, hiyanore saite ekkan ḍõr saddor sair kuna loi duniyait lamai diya or. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>He saddoror uwore hár ḍoilla sair ṭenga zanuwar edde buke aṛede zandar okkol edde faik okkol ase. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Tarfore ek abaze hibare hodde, <char style="wj">"Fitor, uṭ, zora edde há!" </char><verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Fitore hodde: "No, no, Malik, hono mote no, kiyollahoile ãi hono din hono napak, oforiškar no hái."<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Hetunot hibaye dusora bar ei abaz fuinne, <char style="wj">"Allaye zinore Pak goijje, hinore tui napak no hois."</char><verse eid="ACT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Endilla tin bar oiye, toi bade he saddorgan abar asmanot tuli loi za oiye.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Fitore ze deha faiye hiyanor mani ki oitfare, ei babute hibaye ehono bafer, hen šomot Korneliuse defeṛaiyede manuššune Simonor gór tuwaiyore ehon dorozar sarme ai tiyaiyegai. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Tarfore hitara góror butore ḍak maijje edde fusar goijje, Simon, zare Fitor ḍaka o, hiba ki heṛe ase ne, hoi.<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Fitore ehono o deha failde he babute bafat ase, toi Pak Ruhuye hibare hodde, "Sa, tinzon manuše tor talaš gorer. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Toratori gor, lamat za. Hono andeša no ani hitarar fũwati za, kiyollahoile hitarare ãi defeṛaiyide."<verse eid="ACT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Toi Fitore lamiyore oi manuššunor hãse giye edde hodde: "So, tũwara zare talaš goror hiba ãi. Tũwara eṛe kiyolla aiššode?"<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Hitara zuwabe hodde, "Ãrare šenafoti ofisar, Korneliuse defeṛaiyede. Hiba ekzon dormiyo manuš, ze Allare ḍora. Ar har Ihudi okkole hibar šunam gore. Hibaye ek Paki firistattu hokum faiye ze õnore hibar gõrot ḍaki loi zaiyore hibaye õnor hota fune." <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Toi Fitore he manuš okkolore góror butore ḍaki ainne edde hitarare mehemandari goijje.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Tarforor din uṛi hitarar fũwati giye. Ar Zaffa šohorottu ho ekzon torikotor báiyain hibar fisa fise giye. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Tarforor din hitara Sizeriyat fõissegoi. He šomot Korneliuse hitar nizor afonzon, egena, dusto okkolore ek zagat gori hitaralla entezar goijjil. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Bade Fitor zehon górot góille hetunot Korneliuse hibar loi deha oiye edde hibar ṭengot uitefori hibare soida goijje. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Kintu Fitore hitare tuli loiye, edde hodde: "Uṛi zagoi, ãi nize o bolke ekzon manuš."<verse eid="ACT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Kornelius loi hota hoite hoite, Fitore butore zai sadde heṛe beša beši manuš okkol zoma oi taikke. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Hetunot Fitore hitarare hodde: "Õnora to zanode hota ze oinno hono zatir manuš loi aza gora ba hitarar loi dola owa ekzon Ihudilla iyan niyomor baire. Kintu ãre Allaye dehaiye ze honokiyore napak ba oforiškar howa bala no. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Hetolla tũwara zẽtte ãre ḍakito defeṛaila hẽtte hono bázá no raki ãi aišši. Kintu ãi ehon tũwarare fusar gori, tũwara ãre kiyolla ḍakito defeṛailade?"<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Hetunot Kornileuse hodde: "Sair din age ṭik ei šomot, ãi ãr górot munazat goijjilam. Hen šomot atikka ekzon ujjol dola hor finda manuš ãr sarme aiyore tiyaiye. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>Edde hodde, 'Kornelius, tor munazat edde gorib okkolore modotor hota Allar hãse fõisse edde Allaye hin monot raikke. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Ehon tui Zaffa šohorot manuš defeṛai Simon, zare Fitor o ḍaka o.hitare ḍaki ana. Hite Simon name ek samora biyarir górot ase, ze górgan doriyar hãsat.' <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Hetolla ãi hehon õnore ḍaki anibolla manuš defeṛailam. Õne aiššode bala oiye. Ar ãra ehon beggune Allar sarme asi, Malike õnore ãrar hãse ziyan hoibolla hokum diye ãra hiyan funiyum."<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Tarfore Fitore muk kuille edde hitarare hodde: "Soiyi ãi buzi faijji ze Allaye hono manušore forok no gore. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Kintu hár zatir butottu zara hibare ḍora edde ziyan hibar sukot ṭik hiyan ze gore, hitarare hibaye gose. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Tũwara zanode hota, Allaye ei kušir hóbor Israili okkolor hãse defeṛail, Isa Mosir duwara he šantir kušir hóbor, Isa Mosi, hiba ziba beggunor uwore Malik. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Tũwara beggune ei goṭona zano ze Yahyar duwara torikotor gusol tobolig gora oi bade Galilottu loti šuru gori šara Ehudiya agagura ei hóbor sorai gilgoi. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Ar Allaye kibafe Nasarator Isare Pak Ruh edde šokti diye, kibafe hibaye hár mikka giye edde bala ham okkol goijje, ar zara Šoitanor kobzar butore duk bug goitto, hitara beggunore aram gorito. Kiyollahoile hibar fũwati Allah aššil.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>"Hibaye Ihudi okkolor dešot edde Zeruzalemot zin zin goijje hin beggunor goba oilamde ãra, hitara zara hibare kurušot loṭkaiyore mari felaiye. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Kintu Allaye hibare tin dinor din uwafes tuille, ar endilla goijje zene mainše hibare deke. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Hibare beggune no deke, kintu ze goba okkolore agottu loti Allaye basona goijjil hitarare deha diye. Hiba morattu uwafes uṛi zaigoi bade ãra hibar fũwati hafiya goijjilam. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Hibaye ãrare hokum diye, ãra zene tobolig gori edde goba di, ze Iba oilde he zon zibare Allaye zinda edde mora okkololla bisarhar hisabe buwaiye. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Hibar babute har nobi okkole goba der, ze honokiye hibar uwore biššaš ane, hite hibar namor duwara guna maf faibo."<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Fitore ehono hota howat ase, hen šomot hitara zara he kalam funnil, hitara beggunor uwore Pak Ruh aiššiye. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Ze Ihudi biššaši okkol Fitoror fũwati aiššil hitara Oihudi okkolor uwore o Pak Ruhure hadiya hisabe ḍali diya oiyede deki tajjuf oiye. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Kiyollahoile zilor baša hodde edde Allar tarif goredde hitara fuinne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Toi Fitore hodde: <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>"Itara o ãrar ḍoilla Pak Ruhure faiye. Honokiye ki itarare torikotor gusol dite banda di faribo?" <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Toi Fitore he manuš okkolore Isar name torikotor gusol dibolla hokum diye. Bade hitara Fitorore ho ek din hitarar hãse takibolla foriyad goijje.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Zeruzalemot Fitor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Oihudi okkole o Allar kalam goissede he hota asab okkole edde Ehudiyar har biššaši báiyain okkole fuinne. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Ar zẽtte Fitor Zeruzalemot aišše, he azomi goraiya biššaši okkole Fitorore hosuri diyore hodde, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>"Tũi azomi agoraiya manuš okkolor górot zai hitarar loi kiyolla hafiya goijjo?"<verse eid="ACT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Fitore foilattu loti šuru gori zin zin goiṭṭe ekkan ekkan buzaiyore hoiye. <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>Hodde: "Ãi Zaffa šohorot munazat goijjilam, hẽtte zurainna mikka oi ãi ek deha failam. Ãi dekidde ekkan ḍõr saddoror ḍoil ziniš sair kuna loi asmanottu lamai diya or, ar hiyan ãr hãse aišše. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Ãi hiyanore kiyal gori sailam, ar dekidde sair ṭenga zanuwar edde fahari zanuwar okkol, buke aṛede zandar edde faik okkol ase. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Toi ãre hodde ek abaz fuinni: <char style="wj">'Fitor, Fitor, uṭ, zora edde há'</char><verse eid="ACT 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>"Ãi hoilam: 'No, No, Malik, ãi hono mote hái no faijjum, kiyollahoile ãi hono din hono napak, oforiškar no hái.'<verse eid="ACT 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>"Kintu dusora bar asmanottu howa oiye: <char style="wj">'Allaye zinore paksaf goijje hinore tui napak no hois.'</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Endilla tin bar oiye, toi bade hin beggun abar asmanot tuli loi za oiye.<verse eid="ACT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>"Ar hin deki mottor dekidde tinzon manuš, ãra ze górot aiššilam heṛe ai tiyaiyegai. Hitarare Sizeriya šohorottu defeṛa oil. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Hetunot Pak Ruhuye ãre hono andeša no ani hitarar fũwati zaito hoiye. Ei sozon báiyain itara o ãr fũwati gil. Bade ãrare ze ḍakito defeṛail he manušwar gõrot goillilam. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Hite ekzon firistare ki bafe hitar górot deha fail hin hite ãrare hoiye. He firistaye hitare hoil, 'Zaffa šohorot manuš defeṛai Simon, zare Fitor o ḍaka o, hitare ḍaki an. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Hite tor hãse kalam hoibode he kalamor duwara tui edde tor góror gušṭi ṭiyaye uddar faibo.'<verse eid="ACT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>"Bade ãi hota howa šuru goijjibar, Pak Ruh hitarar uwore aišše, zendilla foilar šurut ãrar uwore aiššil. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Hetunot ãttu Malikor hota monot foijje, zendilla hibaye hoil: <char style="wj">'Yahyaye fani loi torikotor gusol dito, kintu tũwarare he Pak Ruh loi torikotor gusol diya oibo.'</char> <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Allaye zehon hitarare o he hadiya diye ziyan ãra Malik Isa Mosir uwore biššaš ainnide hiya failam, henot ãi honnuwa ze Allare banda di fari?"<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Hitara in okkol zehon fuinne, toi nizam oiye edde Allare tarif goriyore hodde: "Henoile to Allaye Oihudi okkolore o gunattu mon firaiyore zibonot aibolla šuzug diye."<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anṭiyokot foila Isayi zomat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Ehon Stifanore loi šuru oilde he zulumor zoriya biššaši okkol zara Fonikiya, Kiprus, edde Anṭiyok foijjonto sorai gilgoi, hitara šude Ihudi okkolore sara ar honokiyore kalam tobolig no gore. <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Kintu hitarar butore Kiprus edde Kuronir hoekzon manuše Anṭiyokot zaiyore Oihudi okkolor hãse Isar babute kušir hóbor tobolig gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Ar Malikor hat hitarar uwore aššil edde bout manuš okkole biššaš ani Malikor mikka fijje.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Ei hóbor zehon Zeruzalemor zomator manuš okkolor hanot giye, hitara Barnabasore Anṭiyokot defeṛaiye. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Barnabas heṛe aiyore zehon Allar rahamote ki goijje hin deikke, hiba kuši oiye, edde hitarare tuwajjo diye zene hitara hitarar furafuri dil diyore Malikore dori take. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>Barnabas ekzon bala manuš aššil edde hiba Pak Ruhuye edde biššaše furaiya aššil. Ar bout manuš okkolore Malikolla zitaiye.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Tarfore Barnabase Saulore tuwaibolla Toršišot giye. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Toi hibare tuwai faiyore Anṭiyokot ainne. Barnabas edde Saule ek bosor foijjonto zomator manuš okkol loi mille edde beši manuš okkolore šikka diye. Ei foilabar Anṭiyokor biššaši okkolore Kiristan hoi nam diye.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>He ṭaimot hoekzon nobi okkol Zeruzalemottu Anṭiyokot aišše. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Hitarar butore Agab name ekzon uṛi tiyaiore Pak Ruhur duwara hodde, Rom raijjo agagurat ek ḍõr raṭ oibo. (Badša Klaudius šašonor ṭaimot he hota furon oil.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Hetunot biššaši okkole bebosta goijje ze Ehudiya elehar biššaši báiboinain okkololla hitarar nizor šaiddo mozin modot faṭaibo. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Ar hitara he mozin goijje, Barnabas edde Saulor hatot Ehudiyar zomat okkolor murubbi okkolor hãse modot faṭaiye.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Fitoror halas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>He šomot badša Herude zulum goribolla zomator hoekzon manušore dori annil. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Hite Yuhannar bái Yakubore toluwar loi kun gori felaiye. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Henot Ihudi okkole kuši oiyede deki hite abar giye edde Fitorore o doijje. In goiṭṭede iš adiya ruṭir idor šomot. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Hite Fitorore dori ziyol golai raikke. Ar Fitorore fahara dibolla sairzon sairzon gori šoinno okkolor uwore bar diya oiye. Herude ṭik goijjede uddar idor bade bisar goribolla Fitorore mainšor hãse niyolai anibo.<verse eid="ACT 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Hetolla Fitorore ziyolot bondi raka oil. Zomator manuš okkole kintu hiballa Allar hãse ekmone duwa goijje.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Ze din Herude bisar goribolla Fitorore niyolai anibo, hiyar agor raitta duizon šoinnor maze Fitor gum zai aššil. Hibare duiyan siyol loi bandi raka oil, ar faharadar okkole dorozat fahara dil. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>So, hen šomot atikka Allar ek firista heṛe aiyore tiyaiyegai. Henot ziyolhanagan fohore ujjol oigiyegoi. Firistaye Fitoror gat zure ṭela diyore gumottu tuli diye edde hodde: "Toratori uṭ!" Henot Fitoror dui hatottu siyol kuli fori giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Hetunot firistaye hodde: "Tor kĩyailot kiyail bandoni band edde šendal find," Fitore hen goijje. Bade firistaye hodde: "Tor saddor gat diyore ãr fise fise ai." <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Henot Fitore niyoliyore firistar fise fise za šuru goijje. Kintu firistar duwara zin gora oiye, hin ze hãsa hin hibaye buzi no faijjil, bolke hibaye šoppon deker buli mone goijje. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Bade hitara foila edde dusora faharadar okkolor dolore ḍiyai zaiyore šohorot golede luwar dorozar hãse aišše. Dorozagan hitaralla onegane kuli giyegoi, ar hitara heṛe butottu di niyoli giyegoi. Hitara ekkan rasta bai, rasta hiyan furafan foijjonto giye. Ar hetunot firistawa atikka hibar hãsottu gayeb oigiyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Hetunot Fitore buzi fariyore hodde, "Ehon ãi buzilam, Malik nize firista defeṛaiye edde Herudor hatottu edde Ihudi okkolor har monor issattu ãre uddar goijje."<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>Ei babute buzi fariyore hibaye Yuhannar ma Moriyamor górot giye. Ei Yuhannare Mark hoi o ḍaka oito. He górot boute ekku fũwati dola oi munazat goijje. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Fitore battu tai doroza bajjaiye toi Ruda name ekzon goroni maya fuwaye doroza kuli dibolla aišše. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Fitoror abaz sini fariyore hibaye eto kuši oiye, doroza no kulite, dũri butore giye edde hoiye, ze Fitor dorozar hãse tiyai roiye!<verse eid="ACT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Hetunot biššaši okkole he mayafuwaware hodde, "Tor mata horaf oiyede oibo." Kintu hibaye bar bar zurgori zehon hoiye hitara hodde, "Toile iba Fitoror firista."<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Eṛe Fitore doroza baijjat roiye. Hetunot biššaši okkole doroza kuli Fitorore deki ammuwak oiye. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Fitore hitarare nizam oibolla hate išara goijje edde ziyolottu Malike hibare kengori niyolai ainne hiyan zanaiye. Toi Fitore hodde, "Tũwara ei hóbor Yakubore edde aro báiyain okkolore hoiyo," hen hoi hiba hentu niyoli oinno zagat giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Binna sore šoinno okkolor maze uruskul oiye, Fitor hoṛe giyegoi hoi. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Herude Fitorore talaš goijje, kintu hibare tuwai zehon no fa, faharadar okkolore zera goijje edde hite hitarare mari felaibolla hokum diye. Tarfore Herude Ehudiyattu Sizeriya giye edde heṛe hoto din taikke.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Herudor mout</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Hešomot Herud Tiros edde Sidon šohoror manuš okkolor uwore guššaye oin oil. Ehon, heṛiyar manuš okkole ekkui fũwati miliyore Herud loi deha gorito gil. Blastos name ekzon badšar góror has hormosari loi hat goriyore hitara badšattu šanti saiye, kiyollahoile hitarar hánar zinišfati okkol he badšar dešottu itarar dešot aito.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Hẽtte ekdin Herude ekkan din ṭik goijje, hite hedin raz fušak findi šingašonot boiyore hitarare bašon diye. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Hitar hota funi manuš okkole guzoriyore hodde: "In oilde devotar abaz, manušor no!" <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Hetunot atikka Mabudor ekzon firistaye hitare maijje, kiyollahoile hite Allare tarif no de. Hitar ga loge háiye edde morigiyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Kintu Allar kalam mummikka giye edde sairo mikka sorai gilgoi. <verse eid="ACT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Ar Barnabas edde Saule Zeruzalemot hitarar šebar ham šeš gori bade, Yuhanna, zare Mark ho hibare fũwati loi hitara uwafes firi giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Barnabas edde Saulore toboligot faṭaiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Anṭiyok šohoror zomatot hoekzon nobi edde ustat aššil. Hitarar nam Barnabas, Simeon zare Niger o ḍaka oito, Kuroni šohoror Lukiyus, šašon goroya Herudor falok bái Manaen, edde Saul. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Hitara ruza rakiyore Mabudor ebadot goredde hetunot Pak Ruhuye hitarare hodde: "Barnabas edde Saulore ãi ze hamolla ḍaikki he hamolla hitarare aleda gori lo!" <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Toi hitara ruza edde munazat gori bade he duizonor uwore hat raikke edde hitarare faṭaiye.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kiprusot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Ei dunizonore endilla gori Pak Ruhur duwara defeṛa oil, hitara dunizon Selebkiyat giye, hentu zahazot gori Kiprus ḍiyat aišše. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Hitara Salamit hazir oiyore Ihudi okkolor sinagogot Allar kalam tobolig goijje. Yuhanna o modot goroya hisabe hitarar fũwati aššil. <verse eid="ACT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Hitara ḍiya gũṛa farai zaiyore šeše Pafosot hazir oiye. Heṛe hitara ekzon Ihudi zadugor edde bonḍo nobire lot faiye, zar nam Bar-Isa. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Hite aššilde šašon goroya Sergius Paulosor ekzon bondu, ar he šašon goroya manušwa aššil ekzon bala manuš. Sergius Paulose Allar kalam funibolla Barnabas edde Saulore ḍaikke. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Kintu Elymas, ze namor mani zadugor, hite Barnabas edde Saulore mana goijje ar hite sailde šašon goroyaye biššašottu muk firai felok. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Kintu Saul zare Paulos ho, hibaye Pak Ruhuye furaiya oiyore hitar mikka šuza saiyore <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>hodde: "Tui Šoitanor fuwa, zin bala hinor dušmon edde hár ḍoilla dúha edde sokkore furaiya, tui ki Malikor uzu fõtore behã gora no tamaibi ne ki? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Sa, tor uwore Allar gozob foijje. Tui anda oibi edde hoto din foijjonto beilor fohor no dekibi."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Hetunot kuwa edde andare hitare guri felaiye, edde honokiye hitare hate dori loizai farefan hite ata šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>In okkol deki he šašon goroyaye biššaš ainne. Kiyollahoile Malikor babute ze šikka hibaye faiye henot hiba tajjuf oiye.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pisidiya elehar Anṭiyok šohorot tobolig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Bade Paulos edde hibar fũwajja okkol Pafos sari zahazot gori Famfuliya elehar Forga šohorot giye. Heṛe Yuhannaye hitarare eri Zeruzalem firi giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Bade hitara Forgattu Pisidiya elehar Anṭiyok šohorot giye edde dórmo din sinagogot goli zai boiššegoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Torah edde nobi okkolor kitabottu telewat goijja šeš oi bade muzolišhanar neta okkole hitarar hãse hoi defeṛaiyede: "Báiyain okkol! Manuš okkolore tuwajjo dibolla zodi hono hota take toile ho."<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Hetunot Paulose uṛi tiyaiye edde hate išara gori hodde: "Israili okkol edde aro zara Allare ḍorode Oihudi manuš okkol, tũwara ãr hota funo! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Israil zatir Allaye ãrar bafdada okkolore basiloil. Hitara zẽtte Mišor dešot aššil hẽtte hitarare ek ḍõr zati goijjil. Bade Allaye ḍõr kudurutir duwara he dešottu hitarare niyolai ainnil. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Onumanik sališ bosorfan bošoti sara elehat hitarar oinnai bebar bordaš goriyore hitarar fũwati aššil. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Bade hibaye Kenanot hãt zatire furai felaiye. Ar Israil zatire he šomosto zatir dešore diye. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Endilla owat sair šo fõnzaš bosorfan haṛi giyegoi. Tarfore nobi Samuelor ṭaim foijjonto Allaye hoekzon bisarhar okkolore dil. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Tarfore manuš okkole ekzon badša sail hetolla Allaye Benjaminor bongšor ekzon manuš, Kišor fuwa Saulore hitaralla badša hisabe diye, ze sališ bosorfan raza aššil. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Tarfore Allaye hibare lari hitarar raza oibolla Daudore tuille, zar babute Allaye hoil, hiba oilde he Daud: 'Ãi Yasiror fuwa Daudore faiyi, hite ãr monor moto manuš, hite ãr šomosto issa falon goribo.'<verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>"Allaye hibar wada hisabe ei manušwar bongšo okkolor butottu basailoya Isare Israili okkolor hãse hazir goijjil. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Isa aibar age har Israili okkolor hãse Yahyaye gunattu mon fira edde torikotor gusol tobolig goijje. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Ham šeš goribar šomot Yahyaye hodde: 'Ãi hiba no, tũwara ziba ãi oi boli mone goror. Kintu ãi bade en ekzon ze aiyer, ãi hibar zutar fita kuli dibar laikka o no.'<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>"Báiyain okkol, Ibrahimor bongšor manuš okkol edde allawala Oihudi manuš okkol, uddaror ei hóbor hiyan ãrar hãse faṭa oiye. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Zeruzalemor manuš okkole otóba hitarar neta okkole hiba honnuwa sini no fare, hitara hibare hosurbon goriyore, ze kalam okkol hitara fotti dórmo din telewat gorito he šob kalam furon goijje. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Ar moron šaza dibolla hono hosuri no fa, tarfore o kintu hitara Filator hãse dabi goijje, zene hibare mari fela o. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Ar hibar babute zin leka aššil hitara hin beggun furon goijje. Bade hitara hibare gasottu lamaiye edde ek hoborot rakkilgoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Kintu Allaye he mora okkolor butottu hibare zinda tuille. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Galilottu zara hibar fũwati Zeruzalemot aiššil hitarare hibaye bout din foijjonto deha diye. Ehon hitara manušor hãse hibar goba.<verse eid="ACT 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>"Hetolla ãra tũwarar hãse he kušir hóbor tobolig gorir. Ãrar bafdada okkolore Allaye ze wada goijjil, <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>hiyan Allaye Isare uwafes zinda gori tuli, ãra zara hitarar bongšo okkol, hitarar hãse wada furon goijje, zendilla dui lombor zoburot o leka ase:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">"'Tui ãr fut,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">aziya, ãi tor baf oilam'<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>Allaye ze hibare morattu zinda goijje edde hibar ga ze ar hono din nošto no oibo, ei babute Allaye hor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">"'Ãi Daudor hãse ze Paki edde haṭi duwar wada goijji, hin ãi tũwarare dium.'<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Ar ek zagat hibaye hodde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">"'Tui tor Paki zonore fõsito no dibi.'<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>"Daude hibar amolot, hiba ek zon Allar gulam aššil. Tarfore hiba mori giyoi edde hibar bafdada okkolor fũwati hibare hobor diya oil, ar hibar ga fõsi giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Kintu Allaye zare morattu zinda tuille hibar ga no fõse.<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>"Hetolla oh ãr báiyain okkol! Tũwarattu iyan zana zoruri, ze Isar duwara gunattu maf faibar babute tũwarar hãse tobolig gora or. <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>Tũwara Musar ainor duwara gunar šazattu rehai fai no faro, kintu ze hono kiye Isar uwore biššaš ane hite gunar šazattu rehai fa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Etolla tũwara hũšiyar o! Zene nobi okkole hoi giyede hen tũwarar uwore no goṭe:<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>"'Tũwara zara omainno goroya okkol,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">so edde ammuwak o edde dongšo o.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Kiyollahoile tũwarar din okkolot ãi ekkan en ham goijjum.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Zodi o he hamor hota honokiye tũwarare ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">hiyan biššaš no goriba.'"<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Paulos edde Barnabas sinagog sari zargoide šomot, manuš okkole hitarare foriyad goijje, zene hitara sarmor baror dórmor din ei babute aro kissu ho. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Muzolišhanar šoba šeš oi bade bout Ihudi okkol edde Allar ḍorola Ihudi zat diyede manuš okkole hitarar fisa loiye. Paulos edde Barnabase hitarar loi hota hoiye edde hitarare tuwajjo diye zene hitara Allar rahamotor butore mojbut take.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Tarforor haftat dórmor din šohoror hár manuš okkol Allar kalam funibolla dola oiye. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Eto manušor zam oiyede dekiyore Ihudi okkole hingšaye zoli uiṭṭe. Ar Paulose zin tobolig goijjil hitara hinor berudde nanan ḍoilla hota okkol hoi hibare ninda gora šuru goijje.<verse eid="ACT 13:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Hetunot Paulos edde Barnabase šahoš loi hodde: "Allar kalam age ãrattu tũwarar hãse tobolig goron dorhar aššil. Kintu tũwara zehon hiyanore hela goror edde nizore akeri zibon faibar belaikka gori tulor, toile ãra Oihudi okkolor hãse zaiyum. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Kiyollahoile Mabude ãrare endilla hokum diye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">"'Ãi oinno zati okkolor hãse tore fohoror ḍoil goijji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">zene tui uddarore duniyair šeš šima foijjonto loizos.'"<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Oihudi okkole ei hota okkol zẽtte fuinne hẽtte hitara kuši oiye edde Mabudor kalamor tarif goijje. Ar zarare akeri zibonolla basi lowa oil, hitara beggune biššaš goijje.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Mabudor kalam he elehar hár mikka sorai foijje. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Kintu Ihudi okkole Allar ḍorwala tuwangor mayafuwain okkol edde šohoror ḍai ḍõr manuš okkolore uskani diye. Endilla gori hitara Paulos edde Barnabasor uwore zulum goriyore he elehattu hitarare niyolai diye. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Hẽtte Paulos edde Barnabase he manuš okkolor berudde hitarar ṭengor dul zari felai Ikuniya šohorot giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Kintu heṛiyar biššaši okkole kuši edde Pak Ruhuye furon oiye.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ikuniya šohorot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Tarfore Paulos edde Barnabas Ikuniya šohorot hitarar niyom mozin Ihudi sinagogot góille edde heṛe hitara endilla gori hota hoiye ze, ek dõr Ihudi edde Oihudi okkolor dole biššaš ainne. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Kintu ze Ihudi okkole biššaš nu ane hitara Oihudi okkolore Paulos edde Barnabasor berudde uskani diyore hitarar dilore tita gori tuille. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Tarfore o Paulos edde Barnabas bout din heṛe tai zaigoiyore šahoš edde Malikor uwore boroša raki tobolig goijje. Ar Malik nize hitarar duwara he keramot edde sinno okkol goṭabaiyore hibar rahamotor hotar goba diye. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Hiyanor zoriya šohoror manuš okkol dui bag oi giyegoi, ek dol Ihudi okkolor foikka, ar ek dol asab okkolor foikka loiye. <verse eid="ACT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Oihudi edde Ihudi okkol, dui dole hitarar neta okkol loi mili Paulos edde Barnabasore ottisar goribolla edde fattor maribolla felain goijjede buzi faijje, <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>hitara Lukainiyar Lystra edde Dorbi šohorot edde heṛiyar ate hãsor zaga okkolot dai dai roiye. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Ar heṛe o hitara kušir hóbor tobolig goijje.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lystra edde Dorbi šohorot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Lystra šohorot ekzon manuš boi takito, hitattu tiyaibar hono šokti nuwaššil, hite fodaši ãtur ze hono din nu ãṛe. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Hite Paulosor hota funnil, Paulose šuza hitar mikka saiye, ar dekedde hite aram oibolla hitattu biššaš ase. <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>Toi hitare zure ḍak maijje: "Tor ṭengor uwore bor di uzu oi tiya." Toi hite fal mari tiyaiye edde aṛa šuru goijje.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Paulose zin goijje hin manuš okkole Lukaniyo zubanot guzoriyore hodde, "Devota okkol manuš ruf loiyore ãrar hãse lami aišše." <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Ar mainše Barnabasore Zaius nam diye, ar Paulos asol hota hoiya aššil buli hibar nam diye Harmes. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Zaius devotar mondir aššilde he šohoror baire. Šohor geiṛot dorozar sarme Zaius devotar mondiror imame hougguwa bolod goru edde fulor mala loi aiššiye, kiyollahoile he imam edde hár mainše Paulos edde Barnabasolla kurbani dito saiye. <verse eid="ACT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Kintu asab Barnabas edde Paulose he hota zehon fuinne, hitara nizor hor faṛi dũri mainšor butore giye edde guzori hodde, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>"Bondu okkol! Tũwara in kiyolla gorodde? Ãra o tũwarar ḍoilla insan. Ãra tũwarare ei kušir hóbor tobolig gorir zene tũwara ei šob abi zabi hamottu zinda Allar hãse firi aiyo, ze asman, zobin, duniyai, doriya edde hin butore za kissu ase beggunore sirišti goijje. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Agor din okkolot har zatire hibaye hitarar issa mozin solito diye. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Tarfore o kintu hibaye hamiša hiba nizor babute goba diye, asmanottu zór edde ainda mozin haiddo diyaiyore hibaye hibar doyare tũwarare dehaiye. Hibaye beša beši haiddo zuhai diyore tũwarar dilore kušiye borai tuille." <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Ei hota okkol honor bade o, Paulos edde Barnabasolla zanuwar kurbani gorattu manuš okkolore tamaite beši hošto oiye.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Bade Anṭiyok edde Ikuniyattu hoekzon Ihudi ai Paulos edde Barnabas berudde manuš okkolore uskani diye. Henot mainše Paulosore fattor maijje edde hibare šohoror baire ṭani loigiye, kiyollahoile hitara mone goijje, hiba mori giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Kintu biššaši okkol hibar sairo mikkattu dola oiye, bade hentu uṛi šohoror butore firi giye. Tarforor din hiba edde Barnabas Dorbi šohorot giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siriyar Anṭiyok šohorot firi giye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Dorbi šohorot kušir hóbor tobolig goijje edde bout manuš okkolore biššaši goijje. Tarfore hitara uwafes Lystra, bade Ikuniya, bade hentu Anṭiyokot firi giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Heṛe hitara biššaši okkolore dilot šokti edde boroša diye, biššaše mojbut takibolla, ar hodde: "Ãrattu bout duk hošṭor mazottu di Allar raijjot gola foribo." <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Paulos edde Barnabase hitara fotti muzolišolla murubbi okkol tuille. Ar ruza edde duwa goijje, ar zara Malikore biššaš goijjil hitarare Mabudor hatot gosai diye. <verse eid="ACT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Tarfore hitara Pisidiyar butottu di Famfuliya aišše. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Tarfore hitara Forgat maze Allar kalam tobolig gori bade hentu Attaliya giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Bade Attaliyattu zahazot gori Anṭiyokot firi aišše, zeṛe hitarare ei hamolla Allar rahamotor hãse šebi diya oil, ziyan ehon gori šeš oiye. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Hitara zehon firi aišše, toi zomator beggunore ekottro goijje edde hitarare beggun hoiye, Allaye hitarar duwara ze ham okkol goijje edde kibafe Oihudi okkololla biššašor doroza kuli diye, he hota okkol hitarare kulasa gori zanaiye. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Bade hitara biššaši okkolor heṛe lamba ṭaim taikke.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Zeruzalemot faisalar boiṛok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Ho ekzon manuš Ehudiya elehattu lami nise Anṭiyok šohorot aiyore torikotor báiyain okkolore endilla hoi šikka diya šuru goijje: "Musar ain mozin tũwara azomi goraiya no oile, tũwara uddar oi no fariba." <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Iyan loi hoijja oiye, Paulos edde Barnabasor loi ei manuš okkolor maze beša beši hota haṛa haṛi oiye. Toi hitara iyan ṭik goijje ze Paulos edde Barnabas, aro hoekzon šoho beggune uwore Zeruzalem zaibo edde heṛe asab okkol edde he murubbi okkol loi ei suwalor babute biyasana goribo. <verse eid="ACT 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Anṭiyokor zomate hitarare zaibolla bebosta gori diye. Toi hitara Fonikiya edde Sameriya bai zaibar šomot Paulos edde Barnabase Oihudi okkol ki bafe mon firaiye ei hóbor heṛe torikotor biššaši okkolore hoiye. Ar hitara hen funiyore beši kuši oiye.<verse eid="ACT 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Zehon hitara Zeruzalem fõisse, zomator mainše, murubbi okkole edde asab okkole hitarare kuši mone goisse. Hitarar duwara Allaye zin zin goijje hin beggun hitara beggunore zanaiye. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Kintu Foroši dolottu biššaši oilde hendilla hoekzon mainše tiyaiyore hodde: "Oihudi okkolottu hameka azomi gora foribo, ar Musar ain manefan hitarare hokum diya zok."<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Toi asab okkol edde murubbi okkole ei babute biyasana goribolla ek zagat ottor oiye. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Bout hota haṛa haṛi gori bade Fitore uṛiyore hitarare hodde: "Báiyain okkol, tũwara to zano ze, bout din age tũwarar butottu Allaye ãre basi loiye, zene Oihudi okkole ãr mukottu kušir hóbor fune edde biššaš ane. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Ar Allaye har mainšor dilore zane, hibaye hitarar foikka goba diye ze ãra zendilla, hitarare o hendilla Pak Ruhure diya oiye. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Hibaye ãra edde hitarar maze hono beš hom no rake, kiyollahoile hitara biššaš ainne boli hibaye hitarar dil o foriškar goijje. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Hen abostat maze, ãrar bafdada otóba ãra ze fũza boi no fari, he fũza Oihudi biššaši okkolor handor uwore tuli diyore kiyolla tũwara Allare forikka goribolla kušiš goror? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Ãra biššaš gori hitara zendilla hendilla ãra o ekkui bafe Malik Isar rahamotor duwara uddar faiyum."<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Hetunot šobar beggune nizam oiye. Ar Paulos edde Barnabasor duwara Allaye Oihudi okkolor maze ze keramoti ham okkol goijje hin okkol hitarar mukottu fuinne.<verse eid="ACT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Hitarar hota hoiya šeš oi bade Yakube hota hoiye, hodde, "Báiyain okkol funo! <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Allaye hibar nizor bonda oibolla Oihudi okkolor butottu ek dol mainšore kengori basi loiye he babute Simeone ãrare buzail. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Ar ei hota nobi okkolor agam hóbor loi mil ase, zendilla kitabot leka ase:<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>"'Iyar bade ãi abar firi aiššum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Daudor fori taikkede gór uwafes tuliyum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Ziyan dongšo oigiyegoi, hiyan abar banaiyum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">hiyan abar noya gori tuliyum.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Zene bad baki manuš okkole Mabudore tuwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">ar zeto Oihudi okkole ãr nam boi loizar,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">Mabud, zibaye ei šob ham gore hibaye ei hota hor,'<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>zin hibattu bout age loti zana.<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>"Hetolla ãr howa oilde Oihudi okkol zara Allar mikka fijje hitarare ãra iyan duk ofan gori no di. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Kintu ãra hitarar hãse endilla leki faṭaiyum, zene hitara mutti fũzar har hamottu edde zenar hamottu, ar gola sibi dori marifelai zandaror gusto edde lou hattu dure take. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Ei hokumgun diya bala oibo, kiyollahoile Musaye zin hoiye hin bout age loti fotti šohore šohore tobolig gora oiye. Ar zin zin hibaye leki giye hin fotti dórmo din sinagog okkolot telewat gora o."<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Hetunot asab okkole, zomator murubbi okkole edde aro oinno manuš okkole endilla faisala loiye ze, hitara hoekzon manušore basi loi Paulos edde Barnabasor fũwati Anṭiyok šohorot defeṛaibo. Ehudah, zare Barsabbas hoito edde Silas, zara báiyain okkolor butore ijjotdar manuš, hitarare basona goijje. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Toi hitarar fũwati ei šeṛigan defeṛa oiye:</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Anṭiyok, Siriya edde Kilikiyar</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Oihudi biššaši báiyain okkol,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">tũwarare ãr Šalom.<verse eid="ACT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>Ãra fuinni ze ãrar butottu ho ekzone zaiyore, hitara bout ḍoilla hota hoiyore tũwarare bekub banaiye edde tũwara alabula oiyo. Kintu ãra hitarare hendilla hoibolla no defeṛai. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Hetolla ãra beggune ek oiyore ho ekzonore basi loi ãrar adoijja fũwajja Barnabas edde Paulusor fũwati tũwarar hãse hitarare defeṛair. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Ei dunizone ãrar Malik Isalla buli hitarar nizor zibonore morar fõtot lagai diye. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Ãra Ehudah edde Silasore o defeṛair zene ãra zin lekki hin tũwarare hitarar muke hoi fare. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Pak Ruhuye edde ãra iyan bala mone gorilam ze, ei ho ekkan beši dorhari ziniš sara ar hono oinno fũza tũwarar uwore tulidiya no o. <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>He dorhari zinišgun oilde: Tũwara devotar name kurbani goijjode hána no haiyo, lou, gola sibi dori mari felaiya zanuwaror gusto hattu edde beššagirittu dure tako. In okkolottu tũwarare dure rakile tũwarar balai oibo.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:29">Tũwarar šanti ok.<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Toi hitarare defeṛaiye, hitara lamat Anṭiyokot aišše. Heṛe hitara zomator manuš okkolore ekottro goriyore he šeṛigan hitarare diye. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Hitara hiyan foijje edde hiyane ze tuwajjo diye hin loi beggune kuši oiye. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Ar Ehudah edde Silas, hitara nize o nobi hisabe, hitara o bout hota okkol hoiyore heṛiyar báiyain okkolore tuwajjo edde šokti diye. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33-34"/>Hitara kissu din heṛe taki bade, zara hitarare defeṛail, hitarar hãse firi zaiboilla báiyain okkolottu šanti gori bidai loiye. <verse eid="ACT 15:33-34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Kintu Paulus edde Barnabas Anṭiyokot taigilgoi, zeṛe hitara edde aro bout manuš okkolore fũwati šikka dito edde kušir hóbor tobolig gorito.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulus edde Barnabasor omil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Kissu din bade Paulose Barnabasore hodde: "Aiyo, ãra Malikor kalam tobolig goijjilamde he šohor okkolot torikotor báiboinain okkolor heṛe beraito zai, ar hitara ken ase saigoi." <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Hetunot Barnabase Yuhanna, zare Mark ho, hibare fũwati loi zaito saiye. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Paulose kintu hibare fũwati loizare bala mone no gore, kiyollahoile Marke hitarare Famfuliyat eri hentu gilgoi. He oite hitarar fũwati ar ham no gore. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Hetunot hitarar butore mot omil oiye, hetolla hitara ekzone ekzon loi aleda oigilgoi. Barnabase Markore loi zahazot gori Kiprus ḍiyat giye, <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>kintu Paulose Silasore basi loiye. Ar báiyain okkole Paulus edde Silasore Mabudor rahamotor hatot tuli di bade hitara rowana diye. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Paulose Siriya edde Kilikiya di baisa diye, ar zomat okkolore aro mojbut goijje.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Timoti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Bade Paulos Dorbi šohorot aišše, hentu Lystra šohorot giye. Ar so, heṛe Timoti name ekzon biššaši aššil. Hite aššilde ekzon biššaši Ihudi mayafuwar fuwa, ar baf aššilde Girik zat. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Lystra edde Ikuniyar biššaši báiboinain okkole Timotir babute bala nam gorito. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Paulose Timotire fũwati loi zaito sail buli hitare azomi goraiye, kiyollahoile heṛe ze Ihudi okkol takito hitara zanito Timotir baf ekzon Girik zatide hiyan. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Bade hitara šohore šohore giye edde Zeruzalemor asab okkol edde he murubbi okkole ze hokum okkol dil hitara hin manuš okkolore zanaiye. Ar he niyom okkol falon goitto hoiye. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Ei bafe zomator manuš okkol biššaše mojbut oiye edde hitarar dol din din bari za šuru goijje.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulosore Makeḍoniyat ḍaker</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Pak Ruhuye hitarare Ešia dešot kalam tobolig gorito no de, hetolla hitara Forugiya edde Galatiya deš bai giye. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Hitara Mysiyar hãsa hãsi fõsi, hentu Bitúniya zaito kušiš goijje, kintu Isar Ruhuye hitarare zaito no de. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Toi hitara Mysiya bai lamat Troasot aišše. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Raitta Paulose ek deha fail, hibaye dekedde, ekzon Makeḍuniyar manuš aiyore tiyaiye edde foriyad gori ḍaki hodde: "Makeḍuniyat aiyore ãrare modot goro!" <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Paulose ei deha fai bade ãra Makeḍuniyat zaibolla hehon tiyar oilam, kiyollahoile ãra buzi faijjilam ze Allaye ãrare heṛe kušir hóbor tobolig goribolla ḍaker.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Bade ãra doriyar fõte Troasottu uzu siri Samotrak, tarforor din Neofolisot fõsilam. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Henttu Filifit maze gilam, hiyan Makeḍuniyar he elehar mein šohor edde Romiyo okkolor koloni, he šohorot ãra hoddin takilam. <verse eid="ACT 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Ar dórmor din ãra šohoror baire doriyar farot gilam, ar ãra mone goijjilam heṛe munazator zaga ase. Ãra heṛe boilam edde heṛe ek dol mayafuwain dola oiyede hitara loi hota hoilam. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Ar hitarar butore Tuwatira šohoror Ludiya name ek allawala maya fuwa aššil. Hibaye baiyonna rongor horor beboša gorito. Hibaye ãrar hota funnil. Malike hibar dil kuli dil zene hibaye Paulosor hotat diyan de. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Hiba edde hibar góror manuš okkol beggune torikotor gusol loiye. Bade hibaye ãrare foriyad gori hodde: "Õnora zodi ãre Malikor name biššaši boli mone goro, toile ãr górot ai takogai." Ei hota hoiyore hibaye ãrare ata ati gori dori ṭani hibar gorot loigiye.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulus edde Silas ziyolot</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Ek din ãra he munazator zagat zaidde šomot, ekzon bandir loi deha oilam zattu ek ruh aššil, ziyan loi hibaye goni farito. Hibaye gonafora loi hibar malik okkololla beši ṭiya hamaiye. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Hibaye Paulos edde ãrar fise fise aiššil edde guzori hoil: "Ei manuš itara Šorbo šoktiwala Allar gulam okkol, itara tũwarare nazator fõt zanai dedde." <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Hibaye bout din foijjonto endilla gorat takil. Kintu Paulose ar bordaš gori no fari muk firai he ruhure hodde: "Ãi Isa Mosir name hokum dir, hibar butottu niyoli zagoi." Henot hehon hiba hibattu niyoli giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Kintu hibar malik okkole, lafor aša ar nai deki Paulos edde Silasore dori bazarot šorharor hãse ṭani loigiye. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Hitara itarare Romiyo bisarhar okkolor munttu loizaiyore hodde: "Ei manuš okkole ãrar šohorot beši gonḍogul sirišti gorer. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Itara Ihudi, ar ãra Romiyo. Ãrar riti niti mozin zin falon gora mana, itara hin tobolig gorer."<verse eid="ACT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Henot oinno manuš okkole o hitarar berudde giye. Ar bisarhar okkole hitarar gar hoor siri felaito edde bet maribolla hokum diye. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Toi hitarare beša beši mar dor gori bade ziyolot golai eijje. Ar hitarare bala gori fahara dibolla ziyolarore hokum diye. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Endilla hokum faiyore ziyolare hitarare beši butoror kamerat loigiye edde kundat maze ṭeng ãṭkai eijje.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Kintu ada raitta Paulos edde Silas Allar hãse munazat edde šukuriya gan goijjil edde hodi okkole hin õl gori funnil. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Hetunot atikka ḍõr busal oil, en ki ziyolhanar meṛi udda hafi uṭṭil, ar hannasun šomosto doroza okkol kuligilgoi edde har hodi okkolor band kuligilgoi. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Henot ziyolar gumottu seton oil edde ziyolor dorozagun kula deki, toluwar loi hite hitar nizor zan nize loibolla bebosta loiye. Kiyollahoile hite hodi okkol dai giyegoi boli mone goijje. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Kintu Paulose guzori ḍak mari hodde, "Oh, nizor hoti no goris, kiyollahoile ãra beggun eṛe asi."<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Hetunot he ziyolare serag ani hoi hite dũri butore giye, edde beša beši ḍore hafite hafite Paulos edde Silasor ṭengor sarme foijje. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Toi hite hitarare hentu baire niyolai ainne edde fusar goredde, "Sahab okkol, uddar faibolla ãttu ki gora foribo?"<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Hitara zuwabe hodde, "Tũi Malik Isare biššaš goro, toi tũi edde tũwar gór ṭiyaye uddar faiba." <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Bade hitara hitare edde hitar góror manuš beggunore Malikor kalam hoiye. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Ar he raitta ziyolare hitarare hitar fũwati loigiye edde hitarar haṛa sira gá okkolore duiye. Ar hite edde hitar góror manuš beggune hehon torikotor gusol loiye. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Tarfore ziyolare hitarare góror butore loigiye edde hitarar sarme hána fani ani diye. Hite edde góror manuš beggune Allare biššaš gori faijjede hiyanor uwore hitara beggune beši kuši oiye.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Bade din zehon oiye, bisarhar okkole ziyolaror hãse endilla hokum loi ofisar okkolore defeṛaiye: "Ei manuš okkolore erido." <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Toi ziyolare ei hóbor Paulosore diyegoi edde hodde: "Bisarhar okkole õnorare eri dito hokum diye. Õnora ehon niyoli aiyo, aramor sãte zogoi."<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Hetunot Paulose hodde: "Ãra Romor nagorik oi bade ãrar bisar no gori, beainna mainšor šaikkat ãrare bet mara oiye edde ziyolot diya oiye. Ar ehon ãrare gufone bair gori dito sadde neki? Hen oi no fare. Hitara nize aiyok edde ãrare bair gori loi zok."<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Toi ofisar okkole ei hóbor bisarhar okkolore zanaiyegoi. Itara Romor nagorikde zani fariyore ḍoraiye. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Toi bisarhar okkole aiyore Paulos edde Silasottu maf saiye edde hitarare ziyolottu baire niyolai loigiye, ar šohor sari zaibolla foriyad goijje.<verse eid="ACT 16:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Hitara ziyolhanattu niyoli ai bade Ludiyar górot giye. Heṛe torikotor báiboinain okkol loi deha goijje edde hitarare tuwajjo di bade henttu giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Tessalonika šohorot Paulos edde Silas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Bade hitara Amfipuli edde Apolloniyar mazottu faṛi zai Tessalonika šohorot aiššil, zeṛe ek Ihudi okkolor sinagog aššil. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Ar Paulose hibar niyom mozin sinagogot giye. Hendilla tin dórmor din fan hitarare kitabottu buzaiye. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Hibaye kitabottu mainšore forman diye ze Mosir moron edde mora okkolor butottu uwafes uṛa iyan hameka zorulot aššil. Hibaye hitarare hodde: "Ze Isar hota ãi tũwarar hãse tobolig gorir, hiba oilde he Mosi." <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Henot ho ekzone hitarar hotat biššaš ainne edde Paulos edde Silasor fũwati zug oiye. Ar ek ḍõr Allar ḍorwala Girik manušor dole edde beš hoekzon zimmadar mayafuwainde o zug dil.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Kintu Ihudi okkole rag gori, bazarguwa hoekzon horaf manuš zomula goijjil edde šohorot gonḍogul bazai dil. Tarfore hitara Paulos edde Silasore tuwai bair gori manuš okkolor munttu anibolla Jaisonor górot hamela goijje. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Kintu hitarare tuwai no faiyore Jaison edde ho ek báiyore hitara šohor šasiyot goroyar hãse ṭani loi zaiyore guzori hodde: "Ei manuš okkole fura duniyaire utaltal goijje, ehon hitara eṛe hazir oiye, <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>ar Jaisone hitarare mehemandari gorer. Itara beggune Romor badša hokumor beruddota gorer edde Isa name ar ekzon badša ase boli hor." <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Zehon ei šob hota okkol fuinne, manušor dol okkol edde šohoror šasiyot goroya okkol ũtari uiṭṭe. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Ar hitara Jaison edde oinno beggunottu zomanot loi zabine eri diye.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beriya šohorot Paulos</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Bade raitta torikotor báiyain okkole Paulosore edde Silasore Beriyat faṭai dil. Hitara heṛe fõsi bade, Ihudi okkolor sinagogot giye. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Tessalonikar Ihudi okkolottuwaro Beriya šohoror Ihudi okkolor dil kula mela aššil. Hitara beši ajju loi Allar kalam fuinne edde hinore kobul goijje. Ar Paulose zin hoiye hin soiyi ne naki no saibolla fotti din hitara kitabot maze tuwai saito. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Hitarar butottu bout Ihudi okkole biššaš ainne, hendilla bout tuwangor Girik mayafuwain okkol edde manuš okkole o biššaš ainne.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Kintu Tessalonikar Ihudi okkole zehon zani faijje ze, Beriyat o Paulose Allar kalam tobolig gorer hetunot hitara heṛe aišše edde manuš okkolore uskani diyore gulmal bazai diye. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Henot torikotor báiyain okkole hehon Paulosore doriyar soror hãsat zaibolla faṭai diye. Kintu Silas edde Timoti Beriyat taki giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Zara Paulosore fũwati loigiye hitara hibare Aten foijjonto ainne. Tarfore hitara uwafes aigiyegoi Silas edde Timotilla endilla hokum loi, tũwara zeto toratori šombob ãr hãse aizogoi.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Atenot tobolig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Paulose Aten šohorot Silas edde Timotilla entezar goredde šomot dekedde he šohorgan mutti okkole boraiya, hen dekiyore hibar mon hošoṛi uiṭṭe. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Hibaye Muzolišhanat Ihudi okkol loi, Allar ḍorwala Girik okkol loi edde fotti din bazarot zai zara loi deha oito hitara loi hota hoito. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Toi Efikurian edde Sṭoiki dolor hoekzon fonḍite Paulos loi hotat baza bazi diye. Hitarar butottu ho ekzone hodde: "Ei hotabaze ki hoito sadde?" Kintu kiye kiye hodde: "Hite hono oinno devota okkolor hota zanaito sar oibo!" Kiyollahoile Paulose Isa edde uwafes zindar babute kušir hóbor tobolig goijjil. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Toi hitara hibare hitarar fũwati loigiye edde Eripagas šobar sarme hazir goijje. Hitara Paulosore fusar goijje, "Tũi ze noya šikka tobolig goror hin hon ḍoilla, ãra zani faijjum ne? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Kiyollahoile tũi ze en hodun hota hor zin ãra funi toddo oir. Ar hetolla ei šob hotar mani ki ãra zainto sai." <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>(Hitara ei hota hoiyede kiyollabuli hoile, Atenor bašinda okkol otóba bideši okkol zara heṛe takito hitara šude noya noya hota howa ba funa sara oinno hono kissut ṭaim borbat no goitto.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Hetunot Paulose Eripagas šobat maze uṛi tiyaiye edde hodde: "Oh Atenor manuš okkol! Ãi dekir, tũwara har mikkattu beši dórmidar. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Kiyollahoile ãi guitto giyide šomot tũwarar fũzagór dekkilam. Ar en ugguwa devota zibar uwore leka ase, OZANA DEVOTAR MUTALLEK. Tũwara no zani zar fũza goror, hibar babute ãi tũwarar hãse tobolig gorirde. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Allah ze duniyai edde hiyanor butoror hár kissure tiyar goijje, hiba oilde asman zobinor Malik, hiba manušor hate banaiya fũza górot no take. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Hibattu hono obaf nai, hetolla manušor hatottu o šeba lowa hibattu dorhar nai, kiyollahoile hibaye hár manuš okkolore zibon edde foran ar oinno hár kissu diye. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Hibaye ekzon manušor duwara har zatire banaiye. Hibaye hitarare duniyair agagura bošobaš goitto diye. Hitara hõtte hoṛe bošobaš goribo hin o faisala gori diye. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Allaye iyan goijje zene manuš okkole hibare tuwa, zodi hitara tuwaite tuwaite hitara hibare tuwai fa. Asole hiba ãra honokiyor hãsottu dure no. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>Kiyollahoile ãra hibar butore zinda asi edde solafira gorir, ar basi asi. Zendilla tũwarar hoekzon šaire o hoiye, 'Kiyollahoile ãra o hibar bongšodor.'<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>"Henoile ãra zehon Allar fuwain toile Allare manušor hat edde sinta šokti diyore tiyar goijja šuna rufa ba fattoror mutti ãrattu mone no gora foribo. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Agor mainše no zanito boli Allaye in okkol dekiyore hinore hosuri mone no gorito. Kintu ehon hibaye hár zagat mon firaibolla manuš okkolore hokum diye. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Kiyollahoile hibaye en ekkan din ṭik goijje ze din hiba nizor basona goijja he zonore diyore duniyair bisar goraibo. Ar he zonore morattu zinda tuliyore hár manuš okkolor hãse forman diye."<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Morattu abar zinda uiṭṭe he hota funiyore hitara kiye kiye hãša hãši goijje, kintu ar oinnogune hodde, "Ei babute tũwar hota ãra abar hono šomot funium." <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Hetunot Paulos he šoba sari giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Kintu hoekzon manuše Paulos loi zug diye edde biššaš ainne. He biššaši okkolor butore Dionysios name Eripagas šobar ekzon, Damariš name ekzon maya fuwa, ar fũwati aro hoekzon.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Korontiyo šohorot Paulos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Iyar bade Paulose Aten šohor sari Korontiyo šohorot giye. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Heṛe Akila name ekzon Ihudi manuš loi deha oiye. Pontus destrikot Akila zormo oil. Badša Klaudiuse har Ihudi okkolore Rom šohorottu zaitogoi hokum dil, hetolla kissu din age Akilaye hitar bou Priskillare loi Itali dešottu Korontiyo šohorot aigilgoi. Paulose hitarar heṛe giye. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>Kiyollahoile Paulos o hitarar ḍoilla ṭambu banaoya aššil. Hibaye hitarar fũwati taki ham gora doijje. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Fotti dórmor din Paulose sinagogot Isar babute Ihudi okkolore edde Girik okkolore hota buzaito edde hitarare Isar uwore biššaš anibolla tagid gorito.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Silas edde Timoti zehon Makeḍoniyattu aišše, Paulose šude Allar kalam tobolig goitto, ar Isa Moside hiyan Ihudi okkolor hãse goba dito. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Kintu Ihudi okkole zehon Paulosor berudde hota hoi hibare ofoman gora šuru goijje, hetunot hitarar berudde Paulose hor zarifelai hodde, "Tũwarar louwor dai tũwara nizor matar uwore forok. Ei babute ãr hono dai nai. Ehonottu loti ãi Oihudi okkolor hãse zaiyum."<verse eid="ACT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Toi Paulose sinagog sari Titius Zoštus name ekzon allawala manušor górot giye, zar górgan he sinagog loi bazaiya aššil. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Krispus name sinagog šasiyot goroya edde hitar fura góror gušṭi ṭiya beggune Malikor uwore biššaš ainne edde aro bout Korontiyo okkol, zara hibar hota fuinne hitara o biššaš ainne edde torikotor gusol loiye.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Ek raitta Malike Paulosore sopponot deha diyore hodde: <char style="wj">"No ḍorais, bolke hota ho, suf no takis.</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/><char style="wj">Ãi tor fũwati fũwati asi, honokiye tore sui no faribo otóba tor hoti gori no faribo, kiyollahoile ei šohorot ãr bout manuš ase."</char> <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Henot Paulos der bosor he šohorot takiyore manuš okkolore Allar kalam šikka diye.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Galliyo ze šomot Akaia destrikor šašon goroya oiye hẽtte Ihudi okkol beggune mili Paulosor berudde uiṭṭe edde hibare dori adalotot loigiye. <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>Hitara hodde, "Ei manušwaye endilla gori Allar ebadot goribolla uskani der ziyan ainor ulda."<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Kintu Paulose muk kulibar agottu Gallioye Ihudi okkolore hodde: "Oh Ihudi okkol, iyan zodi hono oinnai ba beši ḍõr hosuri oito toile ãi tũwarar hota funa ãlla ṭik ham oito. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Kintu iyan zehon nam ba hota otóba tũwarar nizor ainor babute suwal, toile tũwara tũwara iyanor faisala gorogoi. Ãi endilla befarot ãi bisar goroya oito no sai." <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Bade hite hitarare adalotottu lorai diye. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Tarfore manuš beggune miliyore sinagog šasiyot goroya Sostinesore dori loizai adalotor sarme mardor goijje. Gallioye kintu hin dekiyore o no dekefan gori taikke.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siriyat uwafes baisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Bout hoto din Korontiyo šohorot haṛai bade Paulose torikotor báiyain okkolottu bidai loiye edde Akila edde Priskillar fũwati doriyar fõte Siriya dešot giye. Paulose manoš goijjil buli zahazot uṛibar age hibaye Kinšeriyat bondorot matar sul haṛi felail. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Tarfore hitara Efisus šohorot fõisse, zeṛe Paulose Akila edde Priskillare raikke. Kintu hiba nize sinagogot giye edde Ihudi okkolore loi Isar babute buzaiye. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Ar hitarar hãse aro hoto din zehon hibare takito hoiye, hibaye takibolla razi no o. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Kintu hitarar hãsottu bidai loiye edde hodde, "Iyan zodi Allar issa o toile ãi abar aiššum." Tarfore hibaye doriyar fõte Efisusottu giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Paulose Sesariya šohorot fõsi zahazottu lamiyore Zeruzalem giye. Heṛe zomator manuš okkol loi mulahat oiye, bade Anṭiyok šohorot giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Anṭiyok šohorot hoto din haṛai bade Paulose hentu baisa di Galatiya edde Forugiya destrikor ek zagattu ar ek zagat zai zai biššaši okkolore tuwajjo di di hitarare mojbut goijje.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apollo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Heṛe butore Apollo name ekzon Alekzanderiya šohoror Ihudi Efisusot aišše. Hiba ekzon bala wazi aššil, ar hibaye pak kitabore o bala gori buzito. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Hibaye Malikor fõtor babute šikka faiye, ar hibaye beši nizor ajju loi hota hoito edde Isar babute soiyi mote šikka dito. Kintu hibaye Yahyar torikotor gusol sara ar hono torikotor gusolor hota no zainto. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Hibaye beši šahoš loi sinagogot hota howa šuru goijje. Hetunot Priskilla edde Akilaye Apollor hota funi hibare hitarar górot dawat diye edde Allar rastar babute hibare aro bala gori buzai diye. <verse eid="ACT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Bade Apollo zehon Akaia destrikot zaito saiye, torikotor báiyain okkole hibare tuwajjo diye edde heṛiyar torikotor báiyain okkole hibare gosefan ekkan šeṛi leikke. Ar Allar rahamote zara heṛe biššaši oil Apollo heṛe fõsiyore hitaralla hiba ek ḍõr modot oil, <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>kiyollahoile Isa ze Mosi hiyan pak kitabottu harot mozin lowa zade hendilla forman dehaiyore Apolloye himmot gori manuš okkolor sarme Ihudi okkolore ekkubare la zuwab gori felail.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Paulos Efisus šohorot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Apollo Korontiyo šohorot aššilde šomot, Paulose he elehar butottu di zaiyore Efisusot aišše. Heṛe hibaye hoekzon biššaši loi dola oiye, <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>edde hitarare fusar goijje, "Tũwara biššaš ainnode hẽtte ki Pak Ruhure faila ne?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Hitara zuwab diye, "No, Pak Ruh asede hiyan udda ãra no funi."<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Hibaye hodde, "Toile tũwara ki torikotor gusol loiyode?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Hitara zuwab diye, "Yahyar torikotor gusol."<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Paulose hodde, "Yahyar torikotor gusol oilde gunattu mon firaibar torikotor gusol. Yahyaye mainšore hoil, ze hibar bade aibode hibare biššaš goribolla, hiba oilde Isa." <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Ei hota funi he biššaši okkole Isar name torikotor gusol loiye. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Toi Paulose hitarar uwore hat raikke, toi Pak Ruh hitarar uwore aišše, ar hitara zilor baša hoiye edde nobi hisabe hota hoiye. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Hitara beggune onumanik barozon furuš manuš aššil.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Tarfore Paulose sinagogot giye edde tin maš foijjonto kub beši šahoš loi hota hoiye. Allar raijjor babute hibaye manuš okkolore buzaiye zene hitara biššaš ane, he kušiš gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Kintu hitarar butore ho ekzonor dil hora oigilgoi buli hitara biššaš nuane edde beggunor sarme Malikor rastar babute beši hingša gora doijje. Toi Paulose hentu giyegoi edde biššaši okkolore hitarattu aleda gori hibar fũwati loigiye, ar fotti din Tyrannuse šikka ditode he holl górot šikka diye. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Endilla dui bosor guzori zaigoi bade Ešia dešot bošobaš goroya Ihudi edde Girik okkol beggune Malikor kalam fuinne.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Šikvar hãt fut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Allaye Paulosor duwara beši tajjuiffa keramoti ham okkol goijje, <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>enki Paulosor bebar goijja gamsa edde gar hor biyaraimma okkolor hãse loigile hitarar ošuk aram oi zaitogoi edde bod ruh niyoli zaitogoi.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Ar hozon sair goroya Ihudi boiddo okkole o bod ruhuye faiya manuš okkolor uwore Malik Isar nam bebar gori bod ruh dafaito kušiš goijje. Hitara hoito, "Paulose ze name tobolig gorer, he Isar name niyoli aibolla ãi tore hokum dir." <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>In okkol goittode Šikva name ekzon Ihudi okkolor ḍõr imamor hãt fute. <verse eid="ACT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Ekdin he bod ruhuye zuwabe hodde, "Isare ãi sini, Paulosor babute ãi zani, kintu tũwara hontara?" <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Hetunot ze manušware bute fail hite he hãtozonor uwore zafai foijje edde hitara beggunore endilla gori hamela goijje, hitara louwe touwe oi lenḍa abostat he górottu dai giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Ei hóbor zehon Efisusor bašinda Ihudi edde Girik okkole zani faijje, hẽtte hitara beggunor butore ḍor góille, edde Malik Isar namore tarif goijje. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Zara Isar uwore biššaš ainne hitara boute aiyore kulasa bafe hitarar horaf hamor babute šikar goijje. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Ar zara zadu ṭuna gorito hitarar butottu boute aiyore nizor nizor kitab okkol ani ekku fũwati dola gori mainšor sarme hin furai difelaiye. Kitabgunor dam hisab gori deha giye ze beggune fõnzaš hazar rufar foiša. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Endilla gori Malikor kalam hár mikka sorai foijje edde hibar šokti mainšor dilot ham goijje.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Ei šob ham šeš oi bade Paulose ereda loiye ze hiba Makeḍoniya edde Akaia zaibo, toi hentu Zeruzalem zaibo. Hibaye hodde, "Heṛe zai bade ãttu Rom šohorot o zai sa foribo." <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Bade hibaye Timoti edde Erastos name duizon hibar modot goroyare Makeḍoniyat defeṛaiye. Ar nize aro hoto din Ešia dešot roigilgoi.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efisusot gonḍogul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Ar he šomot Isar rastar babute loi hotornak gonḍogul šuru oiye. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Dimitiri name ekzon bainnaye Artemis devir mondiror forma loi rufa di šoṛo šoṛo mondir okkol banaito, ar henot mistiri okkolottu o beši lab oito. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Dimitiriye he mistiri okkol edde hitarar ḍoilla harigor okkolor beggunore ek zagat ḍaikke edde hodde: "Báiyain okkol! Tũwara to zano ze ei bebošat ãrattu lab beši bala o. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Kintu tũwara dekor edde funor ze Paulos name ei manušwaye šude ãrar Efisus bašinda okkolore no, bolke Ešia dešor onumanik hár manuš okkolore buzaiyore ekin goraiye edde hitarare bul fõtot loizargoi. Hite ho ze manušor hator tiyar goijja dev devi okkol bole devota no. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Hetolla ehon šude iyan ḍor no o ze ãrar bebošar horaf nam oibo, kintu ãrar ḍõr devi Artemisor mondiror kimot o no takibo. Ar Ešia dešor hár manuš, enki duniyair har kiye ze ei devire fũza gore he devi o ar ḍõr no takibo."<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Ei hota funiyore he manuš okkol guššaye oin oiye edde guzori howa šuru goijje: "Efisusor Artemis devi ḍõr." <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Fũwati fura šohorot gonḍogul bazi giyegoi. Makeḍoniyar Gaiyus edde Aristarkos name duizon Paulosor fũwati gilde fũwajja manušore mainše doijje edde beggune fũwati dol bandiyore hitarare šobar maṛot loigiye. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Hetunot Paulos nize o mainšor dolor hãse zaibolla monša goijje, kintu biššaši okkole hibare zaito no de. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>He dešor hoekzon raz hormosari loi Paulosor bondutai aššil. Hitara o hóbor defeṛaiye ze hibaye bifod matar uwore loi he šobar zagat no za.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Šobar butore manuš okkole kub uzora uzori ar genzam lagaiye. Bešir bag mainše no udda zanito kiyolla hitara heṛe dola oiye. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Ihudi okkole Alekzendarore mummikka ṭeli diye, bade dolor ho ekzone ki howa foribo hitare buzai diye. Hetunot hite hate išara goijje zene manuš nizam o edde hitar bottita fune. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Kintu mainše zehon zani faijje ze Alekzendar ekzon Ihudi, hetunot beggune ek abaze onumanik dui gonḍa foijjonto en hoi guzojje: "Efisusi okkolor Artemis devota beši ḍõr."<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Šešottu, ekzon ḍõr šorkari šohor keraniye manuš okkolore nizam maraiyore hodde: "Efisusor manuš okkol, hosai, hon manuše no zane ze, ḍõr Artemisor mondirore edde asmanottu hiyanor mutti lami foijjede hibare sõloya oilde Efisus šohor de? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Ar ei soiyi hotare honokiye ošikar gori no faribo he hota zaniyore tũwara nizam taka dorhar edde bekufor ḍoil ham no gora zorulot. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Ei manuš dunizone ãrar mondire o luṭ no gore, ar ãrar ḍõr devir hono bod nam o no gore, tarfore o tũwara itarare dori eṛe ainno. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Hetolla funo, Dimitiri edde hitar bainna okkole zodi honokiyor berudde nališ goitto sa, toile adalot to kula ase, ãrattu heṛe šašon goroya okkol ase. Hitara heṛe zai moddima gori faribo. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Kintu tũwarattu zodi aro beši hono dabi dawa take, hin niyom mozin boiṛok boiyore faisala gora oibo. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Asole aijja genzam baijjede hiyanor babute ãrar uwore hosuri forit fare, ei gonḍugulor hono haron dehai no faijjum." <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Ei hota hoi hite he šobagan bangi diye.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Makeḍoniyat edde Girik dešot sofor</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Gulmal tamizaigoi bade Paulose biššaši okkolore ḍakito defeṛaiye. Tarfore hitarare tuwajjo diye edde hitarattu bidai loi hiba Makeḍoniyar mikka baisa diye. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>Makeḍoniya bai zaibar šomot Paulose bout hota okkol hoi manuš okkolore tuwajjo diye. Bade hiba Girik dešot aišše, <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>zeṛe hiba tin maš taikke. Tarfore hibaye hentu zahazot gori Siriya dešot zaito sar funi Ihudi okkole hibar berudde sail solaye, hetolla hibaye ṭik goijjil ze hiba Makeḍoniya bai uwafes firizaibogoi. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Modot goroya hisabe Beriya šohorottu Firosor fuwa Sopatros, Tessalonikattu Aristarkos edde Sekundus, Dorbittu Gaius, Timoti, edde Ešiyattu Tikiyos edde Trofimos hibar fũwati aššil. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Ei manuš okkole age Troas šohorot zai ãralla entezar goijjil. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Iš adiya ruṭir id bade ãra doriyar fõte Filifittu baisa šuru gorilam, ar fãs din bade Troasot hitarar loi dola oilam edde heṛe ãra hãt din takilam.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Utukore zibon diye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Haftar foila din ãra ekkui fũwati Isar ruṭi bangibolla dola oilam. Hẽtte Paulose hitara loi hota hoiye. Tarforor din hitara zaibar hota aššil buli Paulose ada raitta foijjonto hota howat aššil. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Ãra uworor ṭalat ze górot dola oilam heṛe bout beši serag okkol aššil. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Utuk name ekzon zuwan fuwaye he góror kirkirir uwore boi aššil. Paulose bout hotun dori hota hoil boli hite aste aste gumot fori gilgoi. Gum bári oiyede šomot hite tin ṭalar uwottu lamat fori giyegoi, hitare tuli loiyede šomot hite mora. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Hetunot Paulose nise lami giye edde he fuwawar uwore niyuriyore hitare sibi doijje edde hodde: "Tũwara no ḍoraiyo, hite basi ase!" <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Tarfore Paulose abar uworor ṭalat zai Isar ruṭi bangi háiye edde raitta loti binna ofan foijjonto hota hoiye edde hiba henttu giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Zuwan fuwaware hitara zinda górot loigiye edde beši šantona faiye.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efisusor murubbi okkol loi bidair hota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Ãra agottu zai zahazot uṛi Assosor mikka baisa dilam, zentu Paulosore tuli loibar hota aššil. Hibare tuli loibolla ãra loi age hota ṭik aššil, kiyollahoile hiba aṛar fõte heṛe zat aššil. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>Assosot ãrar loi hibaye deha oiye, bade ãra hibare zahazot tuli loilam edde Mitulanit ailam. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Tarfor din ãra hentu baisa di Kios ḍiyar ḍakaḍaikka fõsilam. Tarforor din ãra doriya farai Samos ḍiyat gilam. Iyar bado din ãra Miletusot fõsilam. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Ešiyat zene deri no o hiyanolla Paulose faisela loiye ze hiba Efisusot no oziyore zaiboi. Hibaye Zeruzalem fõsibolla zolti goijjil, zene šombob oile fõnzaš dinna idor dinot hiba heṛe hazir oi fare.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Paulose Miletusottu Efisusot manuš defeṛaiye heṛiyar zomator murubbi okkolore ḍakibolla. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Hitara heṛe zehon aišše Paulose hitarare hodde: "Ešia dešot ai bade foila din loti šob šome ãi tũwarar fũwati kene ṭaim haṛaiyi tũwara zano. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Ihudi okkolor bout ḍoilla dukor duwara ãttu entehanot fora foijje, tarfore o ãi kub šorol mone edde sukor fani loi Malikor šeba gorat roiyi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Tũwarar modot ode hendilla hono kissu tũwarare no hoi ãi nizam no taki, bolke barkule kulasa bafe edde tũwarar góre góre šikka diyi edde tobolig goijji. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Ãi Ihudi edde Girik okkolor hãse goba diyi gunattu mon firai Allar mikka hitarattu fira foribo. Ar ãrar Malik Isar uwore biššaš ana foribo. <verse eid="ACT 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>Ar so, ehon ãi Pak Ruhur hokume Zeruzalem zair. Heṛe ãr uwore ki goṭibo hin ãi no zani. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Ãi šude iyan zani, Pak Ruhuye fotti šohorot ãre ei hota zanaiye ze ãttu ziyol haṛa edde hošto fa foribo. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Kintu ãr foranor hono foruwa no gori, zodi ãi ei dũra šeš gori fari, mani Isaye ze hamor bar ãre diye hiyan šeš gori fari. He ham oilde Allar rahamotor kušir hóboror babute goba diya.<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>"Ehon ãi ei hota zani ze eto din tũwara zarar hãse ãi Allar raijjor babute tobolig goijji, hitarar honokiye ãre ar no dekiba. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Hetolla aijja, ãi tũwarare foriškar gori hoir, hono kiyor louwor daiyottu ãi halas. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Kiyollahoile Allah ki sar hiyan tũwarare zanaite ãi hono din fis fa no gori. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Tũwara nize edde he fura zakor babute hũšiyar taikko, ze zakor uwore Pak Ruhuye tũwarare dehafuna goroya goijje. Allar zomator soolsoroya o, ze zomatore hibaye hibar nizor lou diyore zitte. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Ãi zani ãi zailegoi bade bukalo genḍa bag okkol tũwarar butore aibo edde soolor zakor hoti goribo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Enki, tũwarar nizor butottu manuš okkol uṛi Allar soyire misa banaibolla kušiš goribo, zene biššaši okkolore nizor dolor mikka ṭani loizai fare. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Etolla tũwara seton taikko. Monot raikko, tin bosor dori dine raite sukor fani loi ãi tũwara fottikiyore hũšiyar goijjilam, hono din suf gori no taki.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>"Ar ehon ãi tũwarare Allah edde hibar rahamotor kalamor hãse šebi dilam, zine tũwarare gori tulibo edde Allar Paki bonda okkolor fũwati tũwarare miraz dibo. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Honokiyor šuna, rufa, otóba hor suworor uwore ãi lalsi no gori. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Tũwara nize zanode hota ze ãr ei dui hate ãr edde ar fũwajja okkolor obaf miṭaiye. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Ãi zin goijji hin hár kissu tũwarare dehaiyi, ze endilla dukkor mehennot goriyore ošohai okkolore modot gora dorhar. Ar ãrar Malik Isar ei hota ãrattu monot raka dorhar ze, <char style="wj">'Fattuwaro diyat maze aro beši rahamot ase.'</char>"<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Ei hota hoi bade Paulos beggunor fũwati ãṛu felai munazat goijje. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Bade beggune Paulosore gola sai berai dori hainde edde hibare suma diye. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Paulosor muk hitara ar no dekibo, has gori ei hotagan loi hitara beši šuk goijje. Bade hitara hibar fũwati fũwati zahazor heṛe foijjonto giye.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Zeruzalemor uzu baisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Efisus zomator murubbi okkolottu bidai loi ãra zahazot gori uzu Kus ḍiyat gilam. Tarfore Rudos ḍiyat ailam. Tarfore hentu Patara fõsilam. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Ar heṛe en ekkan zahaz failam, ziyan Fonikiya zaibo. Ãra he zahazot gori baisa dilam. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Bade Kiprus ḍiya dekilam, he ḍiyar doin ḍakottu felai Siriya dešot gilam. Toi ãra Tiros šohorot lamilam, zeṛe ãrar zahaze hiyanor malfottro lamaibar hota aššil. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Heṛe biššaši okkol lot faiyore ãra heṛe hãt din takkilam. Hitara Pak Ruhur duwara Paulosore foriyad goijje hiba zene Zeruzalem no za. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Ãra ei hãt din taki bade ãra baisa dilam. Hetunot hitara beggune, bou fut ziyain loi ãrare šohoror baire barai dito aišše. Heṛe ãra ãṛu felai duwa gori ekzone ekzonore bidai zanailam. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Ekzone ar ekzonor hãsottu bidai loi bade ãra uṛilam, ar hitara górot firi giyegoi.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Tiros šohorottu baisa di ãra Ptolemit fõsilam. Heṛe biššaši báiyain okkolore solam zanai bade hitarar fũwati heṛe ekdin takilam. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Tarforor din ãra baisa di Siriyat fõsilam edde kušir hóbor tobolig goroya Filipor górot takilam. Iba aššilde Zeruzalem zomator he hãt zoinna kušir hóbor tobolig goroyar butottu ekzon. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Hibattu sairzon abiyata mayafuwain aššil. Hitara manuš okkolor hãse nobi hisabe Allar kalam hoito. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Ãra heṛe bout hoto din taki bade Agab name ekzon nobi Ehudiyattu nise lami aišše. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Hibaye ãrar hãse aiyore Paulosor kiyailor zali kuli loiye, hiyan loi nizor hat ṭeng bandiyore hodde, "Pak Ruhuye hor, 'Zeruzalemor Ihudi okkole ei kiyailor zali iyan zar, he manušware endilla gori bandibo edde Oihudi okkolor hãse gosai dibo.'"<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Ei hota funi ãra edde heṛiyar manuš okkole Paulosore Zeruzalemot no zaibolla foriyad goijji. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Hetunot Paulose zuwabe hodde, "Tũwara handiyore ãr monot kiyolla duk dor? Malik Isalla ãi šude Zeruzalemor hodi boinni de no, bolke moribolla o tiyar asi." <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Hibare tamai no fari ãra šabbiš dilam edde hoilam: "Malikor issa furon ok."<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Tarfore ãra ziniš fati gusai loi Zeruzalem gilam. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Ar Sesariyattu hoekzon biššaši okkol ãrar fũwati aiššil edde Mnason name ekzon Kiprus ḍiyar manušor górot ãra takibar hota aššil. Ite aššilde foila biššaši okkolor butottu ekzon.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulos Zeruzalemot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Zeruzalem fõsi bade torikotor báiyain okkole ãrare kušir sãte goisse. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Tarforor din Paulose ãrar fũwati Yakubore saito gil. Heṛe zomator har murubbi okkol hazir aiššil. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Paulose hitarare solam diye edde hibar toboligor duwara Allaye ki bafe Oihudi okkolor butore ham goijje hin ekkan ekkan gori hitarare buzaiye. <verse eid="ACT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Ei hota funi hitara beggune Allar tarif goijje edde Paulosore hodde: "Bái, tui to dehor, hoto hazar hazar Ihudi okkole biššaš ainne, ar hitara beggunottu Musar ain o falon goribolla kub beši ajju ase. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Hitara tor ei babute hóbor faiye, ze tui Oihudi okkolor butore ze forbaši Ihudi okkol take, hitarare Musar ain bad difelaibolla šikka dos. Tui hitarar morod fuwaindore azomi gora edde Ihudi okkolor soledde rosom falon no goribolla mana goros. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Hitara to hameka funibo ze tui eṛe aiššos. Ehon ãra ki goriyum? <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Hetolla ehon tore ãra zen hoi tui hen gor. Ãrattu eṛe en sair zon manuš ase, zara manoš goijje. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Tui itarar fũwati zaiyore nizore pak saf gorgoi. Ar hitarar matar sul hamaibar horos dis. Toi henot beggune zanibo ze, tor babute hitara ze hóbor fail hin misa oi zaibogoi edde tui Musar ain manos. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Kintu Oihudi biššaši okkolor babute zendilla faisela goijji he babute ãra hitarar hãse lekilam ze, mutti okkololla kurbani diya gusto, lou, ar gola sibi marifelaiya hono zanuwaror gusto, beššagiri, in okkolottu hitara dure take."<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Toi Paulose he manuš okkolore fũwati loi zai hitarar fũwati nizore o pak saf goijje. Tarforor din hiba dórmogórot giye. Ar hitarar pak saf oibar ham hõtte šeš oibo edde fotti zonolla hõtte kurbani diya oibo hin funai diye.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulosore bondi goijje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Ar he hãt din onumanik šeš oi giyegoide šomot Ešia dešottu hoekzon Ihudiye Paulosore Dórmogórot deikke. Hitara heṛiyar hár manuš okkolore uskani diye edde Paulosore doijje. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Bade hitara guzori howa šuru goijje, "Israili okkol, uzai aiyo! Har zagar manuš okkolor hãse, ãrar zati edde ãrar ain edde dórmogóror berudde ze šikka di guri bera, hite oilde ite. Hin bade o dórmogórot Girik okkolore ani ei pak zagare napak gorifeler." <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>(Hitara ei hota hoi fajjilde haron oilde, iyar age Efisusor Trofimusore Paulosor fũwati ei šohoror butore dekkil. Hetolla hitara ṭajjil ze Paulose Trofimusore dórmogórot o ainne.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Hetunot gũṛa šohor utal tal oi uiṭṭe. Manuš okkol beggune ekku fũwati dũri aiyore Paulosore dori dórmogórottu ṭani bair gori ainne, edde hehon dórmogóror dorozagun bon gori diye. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Mainše Paulosore marifelaito saiye. En šomot Rom šoinno okkolor komonḍaror hãse hóbor giye, ze šara Zeruzalem šohorot gonḍogul šuru oiye. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>He šoinno okkolor boroye hetunot hoekzon šoinno loi dũri zamor butore giye. Mainše šoinno okkolor boro edde šoinno okkolore deki Paulosore fiṛa bondo goijje.<verse eid="ACT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Toi šoinno okkolor boro aiyore Paulosore bondi goijje, ar duiyan siyol loiyore hibare bandibolla hokum diye. Tarfore hite hiba honnuwa edde hibaye ki goijjede fusar goijje. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Hetunot dolor butottu hodune guzori endilla hor abar ar hodune oinno ḍoilla hor. Henot šoinno okkolor boroye gulmalor zoriya asol befargan zani no fare. Toi Paulosore berekot loi zaibolla hokum diye. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Paulos šeri foijjonto fõsi bade mainšor hatottu rehai faibolla šoinno okkolottu hibare bar gori boi loiza foijje. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Manuš okkol hibar fise fise guzori howa šuru goijje: "Itare marifelo!"<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mainšor dolore hãse Paulosor hota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Šoinno okkole Paulosore berekot golaibo hen šomot Paulose šoinno okkolor borore hodde, "Ãi tũware ki kissu hoi fariyum ne?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Šoinno okkolor boroye hodde, "Tui dekir Girik baša zanos! <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Toile ki tui he Mišor dešor hite no neki, ze iyar age larai goriyore sair hazar kunire fũwati loi bošoti sara elehat gilgoide?"<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Hetunot Paulose hodde, "Ãi ekzon Ihudi, ãi Kilikiyar Tarsus šohoror bašinda, hiyan za ta šohor no. Meherbani gori foriyad gorir, õne ãre manuš okkol loi hota hoito ejazot do."<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Paulose hiyan ejazot faiye, edde hibaye šerir uwore tiyaiyore hat tuli mainšore nizam oibolla išara goijje. Manuš okkol zehon nizam oiye, toi hibaye Ibroni zubanot hitarare hodde:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>"Báiyain okkol, baf okkol, ehon ãi ãr nizor fokke hota hoi, funo"<verse eid="ACT 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Manuš okkole hibare Ibroni bašat hota hodde funi ekkubare nizam oi giyegoi. Hetunot Paulose hodde: <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>"Ãi ekzon Ihudi, Kilikiyar Tarsus šohorot ãr zormo, kintu ãi ei šohorot ḍõr oiyi. Ãi Gamlielor ṭengor ḍake boiyore ãrar bafdadar dinna ainor babute furafuri šikka faiyi. Tũwara zendilla Allar babute issawala hendilla ãi o issawala aššilam. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Isar ei fõtot zara solito hitarar uwore ãi beši mot foijjonto zulum goritam. Ar furuš fuwain edde mayafuwain okkolore dori ziyolot ditam. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Ei hota soiyide hiyanor goba oilde ḍõr imam edde dórmo komiṭir beggun, enki ãi itarar hãsottu Damaskusor dormiyo neta okkolore dibolla seṛi failam edde ei manuš okkolore dori ani Zeruzalemot šaza dibolla ãi heṛe gilam.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>"Ṭaim onumanik dũijja, zẽtte ãi Damaskusor hãsa hãsi aišši, toi atikka ãr sairo ḍakottu asmanottu ekkan ujjol fohoror šoṛak foijjil. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Ãi meṛit fori gilamboi edde ar ãre hodde ek abaz fuinni, <char style="wj">'Saul, Saul, tui ãr uwore kiyolla zulum goror?'</char><verse eid="ACT 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>"Ãi fusar gorilam, 'Malik õne honnuwa?'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">"Hibaye hodde, <char style="wj">'Ãi Nasarator Isa, zar uwore tui zulum goror.'</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Zara ãr fũwati aššil hitara o he fohoror šoṛakore deikke, kintu ze ãr loi hota hoiye hibar hota hitara buzi no fare.<verse eid="ACT 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>"'Malik, ãi ki goritam?'" hoi ãi fusar goijjilam.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">"Malike hoil,<char style="wj">'Tui uṛi Damaskusot za. Tolla ziyan ṭik gori raka oiye hiyan heṛe tore howa oibo.'</char> <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Toi ãr fũwajja okkole ãre hate dori dori loigiye, kiyollahoile he ujjol fohoror šoṛake ãi anda oigilamboi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>"Toi heṛe Ananiyas name ekzon allawala edde Musar ain biššaši manuše ãre saito aiššil. Heṛiyar har Ihudi okkole hibare beši ijjot gorito. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Hibaye ãr ḍake aiyore tiyaiye edde hodde, 'Bái Saul, dor, tor sukor rošni firi aiyok' Ar hehon ãi hibare suke deki farilam.<verse eid="ACT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>"Toi hibaye hodde: 'Ãrar bafdadar Allaye tore basi loiye zene tui hibar issa zani faros, ar he niyaiwalare, mani Isa Mosir deha fos edde hibar mukottu hota funi faros. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Kiyollahoile tui zin deikkos edde fuinnos he babute har mainšor hãse hibar goba oibi. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Ehon tui kiyolla deri goror? Uṭ, torikotor gusol lo edde Isar name ḍakiyore tor gunare duifela.'<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>"Bade ãi Zeruzalem firi aiyore zehon ekdin dormogórot munazat goijjilam, hetunot ãi ek deha failam. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Ar dekidde Malike ãr loi hota hor. Hibaye ãre hodde: <char style="wj">'Toratori gor! Ehon tui Zeruzalem sari zagoi, kiyollahoile eṛiyar mainše ãr babute tor goba diya no funibo.' </char><verse eid="ACT 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>"Ãi hoiyi, 'Malik, ei manuš okkole zane, zara tũwar uwore biššaš anito hitarare mardor gori ziyolot dibolla ãi ek muzolišhanattu ar ek sinagog okkolot zaitam. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Zẽtte tũwar goba doya Stifanore kun gora oil hẽtte ãi heṛe aššilam. Zara hibare kun goijjil ãi hitarar foikka aššilam edde hitarar hor sõllilam.'<verse eid="ACT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>"Toi Malike ãre hodde, <char style="wj">'Tui za, ãi tore dure Oihudi okkolor hãse defeṛair.'</char> "<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Manuš okkol etun foijjonto Paulosor hota funi aššil, kintu ehon hitara uzor di howa šuru goijje, "Itare duniyaittu dur goro! Ite zinda takibar laikka no!"<verse eid="ACT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Hitara guzojje edde hitarar gar hor kuli mela maijje edde asmanor mikka dul ura šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Hetunot šoinno okkolor boroye Paulosore šoinno okkolor berekot loi zaibolla hokum diye. Hite Paulosore souk maribolla edde kiyolla manuš okkole Paulosor berudde guzora guzori gorer hiyan zera goribolla hokum diye. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Paulosore zehon souk maribolla bainde, hetunot heṛe ekzon ofisar tiyai aššil. Paulose hitare hodde, "Hosurbon ṭorai no faro de hendilla ekzon Romiyo mainšore souk mara iyan ki ain mozin or?"<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Ei hota ofisare funiyore hite šoinno okkolor borore hodde, "Ei manušwa ekzon Romiyo nagorik."<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Toi he šoinno okkolor boroye Paulosor hãse zaiyore hodde, "Sai hosai, tui ki Romiyo nagorik?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulose hodde, "Oi, ãi oi."<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Šoinno okkolor boroye hodde, "Ãi nagorik oibolla ãttu beši ṭĩya diya foijje."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paulose hodde, "Kintu ãi zormo oiyi loti ekzon nagorik."<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Ei hota funi zara hibare zera goijjil hitara hehon hentu šori giyegoi. Ar hiba ze Romiyo ei hota šoinno okkolor boroye buzi fariyore hite ḍoraiye.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ihudi dórmo komiṭir sarme Paulos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Ihudi okkole Paulosore kiyolla hosurbon goijjil hiyan soiyi gori zanibolla saiye. Tarforor din šoinno okkolor boroye Paulosor ban kuli diye edde ḍõr imam okkol edde dórmo komiṭir manuš okkolore ekku fũwati dola oibolla hokum diye. Tarfore hite Paulosore loi ani hitarar sarme tiya goraiye.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Ar Paulos ḍõr šobar mikka šuza saiyore hodde, "Oh báiyain okkol, aijja foijjonto ãi har Allar hamot ãr zimmare hono suwal sara falon goijji." <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Ei hota funiyore ḍõr imam Ananiyase Paulosor ḍake zara tiyai aššil hitarare Paulosor galot suwar maribolla hokum diye. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Hetunot Paulose Ananiyasore hodde, "Munafek, Allaye tũware o šasti dibo. Ain mozin bisar goribolla tũi o heṛe boiššo, kintu ãre maribolla hokum diyore to tũi nize ain bangor!"<verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Zara Paulosor ḍake tiyai aššil hitara Paulosore hodde, "Tui Allar ekzon ḍõr imamore ofoman goror!"<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Hetunot Paulose hodde, "Báiyain okkol hiba ḍõr imamde hiyan to ãi no zanitam. Zodi zanitam toile ki ãi ei hota hoitam ne, kiyollahoile pak kitabot endilla leka ase: 'Tũwar zatir netar berudde bura hota no hoiyo.'"<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Tarfore Paulose he ḍõr šobar ek dol ze Sadduki ar ek dol Foroši, ei hota zaniyore Paulose ḍõr šobat maze guzori hodde, "Ãr báiyain okkol, ãi ekzon Foroši edde forošir fuwa. Mora okkol uwafes zinda oibode hiyanore aša goijji boli ãttu bisarot tiya foijje." <verse eid="ACT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Paulosor ei hotar zoriya Foroši edde Sadduki okkolor maze ek hoijja šuru oiye. Ar henot šobar manuš okkol dui bag oigiyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Kiyollahoile Sadduki okkole hodde, heṛe hono uwafes zinda nai, hono firista nai, heṛe hono ruh nai, kintu Foroši okkole in okkolore biššaš gore.<verse eid="ACT 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Henot heṛe beši gulmal šuru oiye. Foroši dolor hoekzon alem uṛi beši hora gori bara bari suru gori diye. Hitara hodde, "Ãra ei manušwar hono hosuri no fair. Oitfare hono ruh otóba hono firistaye itar loi hota hoiye." <verse eid="ACT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>He hoijja endilla doro oiye, šena okkolor komonḍare ḍoraiye ze hitara Paulosore siri ṭura ṭura gori felaibo, hetolla hite šena okkolore hokum diye zene hitara zai manuš okkolor hatottu Paulosore surai loi fuliš berekot loi ane.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Tarforor din raitta Malik Isa Paulosor ḍake tiyaiyore hodde, <char style="wj">"Himmotwala o! Zeruzalemot zendilla tui ãr babute goba diyos, hendilla Rom šohorot o tottu ãr babute goba diya foribo." </char><verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulosore marifelaibar sail</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Tarforor din binna sore Ihudi okkole ekkan sail goijje edde Paulosore hitara marifelai no fare foijjonto kissu no háibo hoi hosom háiye. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Sališzonottuwaro beši manuše ei sail goijje. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Hitara ḍõr imam edde murubbi okkolor hãse zai hodde, "Paulosore marifela no o foijjonto kissu no háiyum hoi ãra doro hosom háiyi. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Ehon tũwara edde ḍõr šobar manuš okkole aro bala gori zera goribolla hoi bahana dehai Paulosore tũwarar sarme anibolla šena okkolor komonḍaror hãse hóbor defeṛo. Hite eṛe fõsibar age ãra hitare furai felaibolla tiyar oi roiyi."<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Kintu Paulosor boinor fuwaye ei sailor hóbor funiyore fuliš berekot giye edde Paulosore he hóbor hoiye.<verse eid="ACT 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Hetunot Paulose ekzon šenare ḍakiyore hodde, "Ei fuwaware komonḍaror hãse loi zo. Itattu hibar hãse kissu hoibar ase." <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Toi hite hitare komonḍaror hãse loigiye.<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Hetunot šena komonḍare he zuwan fuwawar hat sai dori ek ḍaikka loizai fusar goredde, "Tui ãre ki hoito sodde?"<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>He zuwan fuwawaye hodde: "Kissu Ihudiye Paulosor babute aro bala gori zera goribolla hoi bahana gori hibare aiyedde hailla ḍõr šobar sarme loi zaibolla õnor hãse foriyad goribo. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Õne hitarar hotat razi no oiyo, kiyollahoile sališzonottuwaro besi manuše Paulosor entezarot ase. Paulosore marifelai no fare foijjonto ei manuš okkole kissu no háibo hoi hosom háiye. Hitara ehon tiyar oi roiye, šude õne hitarar foriyadot razi oiba he entezarot ase."<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Šena komonḍare he zuwan fuwaware zaito ejazot diye kintu endilla hũšiyari diye, "Ei hota ze tui ãr hãse zanaiyos hiyan honokiyore no hois!"<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulosore Sesariya faṭai diya or</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Šena komonḍare hitar duizon šenare ḍaki hodde, "Dui šot šoinno, hoittorzon gũrar suwari edde dui šot songinwala šoinno raitor nowa baze Sesariya zaibolla tiyar goro. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Ar Paulosolla o gũrar bebosta goro zene hitare o nirafodor sãte govarnar Feliksor hãse loiza za."<verse eid="ACT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Bade komonḍare endilla ekkan šeṛi leikke:<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>Ãi, Klaudius Lysiyas,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">ḍõr ijjotwala govarnar Feliksor hãse.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">Ãr solam goisso.<verse eid="ACT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Ihudi okkole ei manušware dori onumanik marifelaito sailde šomot ãi ãr soinno okkol loi zai hitare hentu uddar gori ainni, kiyollahoile ãi zani faijjilam ze hite ekzon Romiyo nagorik. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Bade ãi zainto sailam kiyolla hitara itare hosurbon gorer, hetolla hitarar ḍõr šobar hãse ãi itare loi gilam. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Ãi buzi faijjilam ze hitarar ainor hotabattara loi hitara itare hosurbon goijje, kintu moribar otóba ziyolot zaibar laikka hen hono hosuri ite no gore. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Ãi zehon zani farilam ze mainše ei manušwar berudde sail goijje, hiyanor zoriya hitare ãi õnor hãse defeṛailam. Zara hitare duši gorer hitarare o ãi hokum diyi zene hitara itar hosurir babute õnor hãse ho.<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Toi soinno okkole šena komonḍaror hokum mozin Paulosore raitta hitarar fũwati Antipatris šohor foijjonto loigiye. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Tarfordin hitara gũrar suwari soinno okkolor fũwati Paulosore faṭai diyore hitara berekot firi aigiyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Gũrar suwari okkol Sesariyat fõsi bade šeṛigan edde Paulosore Govarnoror hatot diye. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Governore šeṛigan fori bade Paulos hon elehar manuš fusar goijje. Paulos ze Kilikiya elehar manuš hiyan zani fariyore <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>hite hodde, "Tore zara hosurbon goijje hitara eṛe fõsilegai ãi tor hota funiyum." Bade hite badša Herudor górot Paulosore fahara diyore sõi goribolla hokum diye.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Feliksor sarme Paulos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Fãs din bade ḍõr imam Ananiyase hozon Ihudi murubbi edde Tertullus name ekzon ukilore loi Sesariyat giye. Ar Paulosor berudde govarnoror hãse nališ goijje. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Paulosore zehon ḍaki ana oiye, Tertulluse endilla hoi Paulosor keisore Feliksor sarme ainne: "Ijjotdar Feliks, õnor anḍare ãra bout din dori kub šantit asi. Õne õnor giyanor zoriya ei zatir bout unnoti goijjo. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Etolla ãra har šomot hár zagat õnore ãrar dilor butottu šukurana guzar gori. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Kintu beši hota hoi õnor šomoi nošto goitto no sai, ar hetolla foriyad gorir, õne meherbani gori hotun ãrar hotagun baiṭṭat funiba.<verse eid="ACT 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>"Ãra dekir ei manušwa ek afod, šob šomoi hite gulmal gorat take. Šara duniyair Ihudi okkolor maze ite gulmal bazai de. Ite Nasaratiyo dolor neta. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6-7"/>Ar ite dórmogór foijjonto napak gorito kušiš goijje, hetolla ãra hitare doijji. <verse eid="ACT 24:6-7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Ãra hitare ze šob hosuri dir, hin õne nize hitare zera gorile hár kissu zani fariba."<verse eid="ACT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Ihudi okkole o fũwati hosuri diye edde hin soiyi boli hoiye.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Hetunot Governore Paulosore išara goijje hota hoibolla, toi Paulose hota howa šuru goijje: "Ãi zani, õne bout bosor dori ei Ihudi zatir bisar gori aiyor, hetolla ãi kuši oiyore nizor fokke hota hoir. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Aijja baro dinottuwaro beši no o, ãi ebadot goribolla Zeruzalem gilamde, zasai gorile õne hiyan asanir sãte zani fariba. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Ãre zara hosuri der hitara dórmogórot ãre honokiyore loi bosa bosi goridde no deke otóba sinagogot ba šohorot, oinno hono mikka manušore uskani diyide o no deke. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Ar ehon itara ze ãr berudde hosuri dehar hinor forman o hitara õnor hãse di no faribo. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Zen oibo ok, ei hota ãi šikar gorir, ze Isa Mosir fõt, ziyanore itara dórmo berudi fõt ho, ãi he fõtot ãr bafdada okkolor Allar ebadot gori. Kiyollahoile Torah edde Nobi okkolor kitabot za kissu leka ase ãi hin beggunore biššaš gori, <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>ar hitara zendilla aša gore ãttu o hendilla Allar uwore ei aša ase ze, soiyi otóba na soiyi beggunore morattu abar uwafes zinda gora oibo. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Hetolla ãi Allah edde manušor hãse hár šomot ãr biyasanare foriškar rakibolla kušiš gori.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>"Bout bosor bade ãi Zeruzalem gilam zene ãi ãr zatir gorib manušore kissu ṭĩya foiša di fari edde zanuwar kurbani di fari. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Hitara ãre dórmogóror uṛanot lot failde he šomot, ãi nizore pak saf goijji, ar heṛe ãre loi mainšor hono genzam, gulmal hono kissu no o. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Kintu heṛe Ešia dešor hoekzon Ihudi aššil, hitarattu õnor hãse aiyon aššil. Ar ãr hono hosuri dibar takile, hitarattu diya forito. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Ar no oile eṛe zara hazir ase hitara hok, ãi zẽtte ḍõr šobar sarme tiya aššilam hẽtte ki hitara ãr hono hosuri fail. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Bolke ei ekkan hotar babute hitara ãre hosuri di fare, ze ãi hitarar sarme tiyaiyore guzori hoilam, 'Mora okkol abar zinda oi uṛibar babute loi aijja tũwarar sarme ãr bisar or.'"<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Isar fõtor babute Felikse kub bala gori zanito. Hite bisar gora bon gori diyore hodde, "Šena komonḍar Lysiyas aile bade ãi tũwarar bisar šeš goriyum." <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Hite Paulosore fahara dibolla ofisarore hokum diye, kintu hibare kissu azadi edde hibar hono nizor bondu bando okkole hibar šeba zotton gori farefan ezajot diye.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Ho ekdin bade Felikse hitar Ihudi bou Drusillare fũwati gori aišše. Hite Paulosore ḍakito defeṛaiye edde Paulosottu Mosir uwore biššašor hota okkol fuinne. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Paulose zehon soiyi bafe sola edde nizore sõli raka edde hãšoror bisaror dinor hota hoiye, hetunot Felikse ḍoraiye, edde hodde, "Tui ehon za, ṭaim mozin ãi tore abar ḍakium" <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Hite aša goijjil Paulose hitare guš dibo. Hetolla bar bar Paulosore ḍakai ani hite hiba loi hota hoito de.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Dui bosor farai zaigoi bade Feliksor zagat Porkius Festus aišše. Feliks Ihudi okkolore kuši goribolla Paulosore ziyolhanat raki gilgoi.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Festusor sarme Paulos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Festus he elehat ai tin din bade Sesariyattu Zeruzalem giye. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Hetunot ḍõr imam okkol edde Ihudi leiḍar okkol hitar hãse zai Paulosor berudde nališ goijje. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>Hitara Festusore foriyad goijje zene hite hitarar uwore doya gori Paulosore Zeruzalem fõsai de. Iyanor motolob oilde, hitara fõtot maze lukai takiyore Paulosore marifelaibar sail solail. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Kintu Festuse zuwabe hodde, "Paulosore Sesariyat bondi gori raka oiye, ar ãi o heṛe hara uwafes firi zaiumboi. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Tũwarar butottu zara leiḍar, hitara ãr fũwati aiyo, hite zodi hono hosuri gori take toile hiyanor berudde bisar do."<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Festus hitarar heṛe ašṭo doš din taki bade hite Sesariyat uwafes firi giyegoi. Tarforor din hite adalotor siyarot boišše edde Paulosore hitar sarme anibolla hokum diye. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>Paulos zehon hazir oiye, ze Ihudi okkol Zeruzalemottu aišše hitara sairo ḍakottu tiyai Paulosor berudde bout beši ḍoilla hosuri okkol diye, kintu hinor hono forman hitara di no fare.<verse eid="ACT 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Hetunot Paulose hibar nizor foikka ei hotagan hoiye: "Ãi Ihudi okkolor ain, dórmogór otóba Romor badšar berudde hono bul no gori."<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Festuse Ihudi okkolore kuši goitto saiye, hite Paulosore hodde: "Ei mamelar bisar ãi Zeruzalemot goitto sair, tui heṛe zaito razi asos ne?"<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Paulose zuwabe hodde: "Ãi ehon Romiyo adalotor sarme tiyat, ãr bisar eṛe gora ok. Ãi Ihudi okkolor hono oinnai no goride hiyan to õne bala gori zano. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>To zodi ãi hono kissu goijjide hiyanolla hosurbon oi taki edde šazaye mout fai, toile ãi morite ošikar no gori. Kintu itara ãr uwore ze hosurigun diye hinot ei Ihudi okkol soiyi no, hetolla hitarar hatot ãre tuli dibolla honokiyor hok nai, ãi Romor badšar hãse afil gorir!"<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Hetunot Festuse hitar mošora doya okkol loi mošora gori bade, hite hodde: "Tui badšar heṛe zehon afil goror, toile badša heṛe zaibi!"<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Badša Agrippa Festusore saito giye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Hoekdin bade badša Agrippa edde hitar boin Berenik, hitara Festusore solam zanaibolla Sesariyat aišše. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Hitara heṛe bout din takkil buli Festuse Paulosor babute badšar sarme boyan goijje. Hite hodde: "Filikse ekzon manuš ziyolot raki giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Ãi zẽtte Zeruzalem gilam hẽtte ḍõr imam edde Ihudi leiḍar okkole endilla hoi ei manušwar berudde beši nališ zanail edde hitar šasti saiye.<verse eid="ACT 25:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>"Ãi hitarare hoilam, hono manušor berudde zodi hono nališ gora o, toile zara nališ goijje hitarar sarme nizore hosuri sara forman goribar šuzug diya no o foijjonto hitare šasti diya hiyan Romiyo okkolor niyomot nai. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>He Ihudi okkol ãr fũwati eṛe aišše bade ãi deri no gori tarforor din bisarot boiššilam edde he manušware ḍakai anibolla hokum dilam. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Ze manuš okkole hitare hosuri dil hitara zehon hota hoibolla uṛi tiyaiye hẽtte ãi zendilla baffilam hendilla hono nališ hitara no gore. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Bolke hitarar dórmo mozin edde Isa hoi ekzon mora manušor babute loi adalotot nališ goijje. Paulos name he manušwaye dabi goijje, ze he Isa zinda ase. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Ei mamelar zasai basai kengori goriyum hin buzi no fari ãi fusar goijjilam, ei šob mamelar bisar gora ofan hite Zeruzalem zaibolla razi ase ne nai. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Kintu hite zehon Romor badšar raiolla entezar gori ãr hãse afil goijje, hetunot Romor badšar hãse no defeṛai foijjonto hitare fahar di rakibolla ãi hokum diyi."<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Toi Agrippaye Festusore hodde, "Ãi nize ei manušwar hota funibolla sai."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Festuse hodde, "Hitar hota tũi hailla funi fariba."<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Tarforor din badša Agrippa edde Berenik, šoinno okkolor ḍõr ofisar edde šohoror mein mein manuš okkolore loi beši zakzomok loi šoba góror butore góille. Festusor hokume Paulosore heṛe ana oiye. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Hetunot Festuse hodde: "Badša Agrippa edde aro zara eṛe hazir aso, tũwara ei manušware dekor, har Ihudi okkole Zeruzalemot edde Sesariyat ãr hãse afil goijje edde guzori hoiye, ze ei manušwa ar basi takon no sa. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Kintu ãi dekilam, ze moron šasti faibar laikka hono hosuri hite no gore. Tarfore o zehon hite Romor badšar hãse afil goijje hetunot ãi o hitare Romor badšar hãse defeṛaiyum ṭik gorilam. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Kintu badšar hãse lekifarifan en hono soiyi hosuri kissu no failam. Hetolla ãi tũwara beggunor sarme, has gori badša Agrippa, tũwar sarme hitare ainni zene hitare zera gori homse hom kissu ãi leki fari. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Kiyollahoile ãr mote hono bondire salan dibar šomot hitar hosurigun o zana dorhar."<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agrippaye Paulosore hodde, "Tor nizor fokke hota hoibolla tore ejazot diya giye."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:1">Hetunot Paulose hat barai diyore nizor fokke ei hota hoiye, <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>"Oh badša Agrippa, Ihudi okkole ãre ze hosuri diye hinor berudde õnor sarme aijja ãi nizor fokke hota hoibar šuzug faiyore ãi nizore baggitta mone gorir, <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>has gori zehon Ihudi okkolor soledde niyom edde hitarar barabarir babute õnottu bala gori zana ase. Hetolla doijjo dori ãr hotagun funibolla ãi õnore meherbani gori foriyad gorir.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>"Ihudi manuš okkol beggune zane, šoṛo hale loti ãr nizor dešor manuš okkol edde bade Zeruzalemor manuš okkole zane ãi ki bafe zibon haṛaiyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Hitara ãre bout din dori sine. Ar hitara issa gorile goba o di faribo, ze ãrar dórmiyo Foroši name ze hora dol ase, ãi he Foroši zibon haṛaiyi. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Ar ehon Allaye ãrar bafdada okkolor hãse ze wada goijjil hinor uwore aša goijji buli ãr bisar or. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Ãrar baro bongšor manuš okkole dine raite zan foran diyore Allar ebadot goijjede hisabe he wada furon oiya dekibolla he ašat ase. Badša sahab, ei ašar zoriya Ihudi okkole ãre hosurbon gorer. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Allaye morare zinda tuillede ei hota kiyolla tũwara honokiye iyanore biššaš lagede hendilla mone no goror?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>"Ãi nize o mone goritam ze Nasarator Isar namor berudde zen zen gora za hin beggun ãttu o gora dorhar buli. <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Ar ṭik hen ãi Zeruzalemot goijjilam. Ḍõr imamottu kemota faiyore ãi bout Isar uwore biššaši okkolore ziyolot ditam edde hitarare marifelaibar šomot hitarar berudde boṭ ditam. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Hitarare šasti dibolla ãi har sinagog okkolot zaitam ar Isar berudde hoibolla ãi hitarare zur goritam. Hitarar uwore ãttu eto rag aššil ze hitarare zulum goribolla ãi bidešor šohor okkolot foijjonto zaitam.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>"Endilla ek bar ḍõr imamor hãsottu kemota edde hokum loi ãi Damaskus zair. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Badša sahab, hẽtte ṭaim onumanik dũijja, fõtot maze beilottuwaro ujjol ekkan fohor asmanottu ãi edde ãr fũwajja okkolor sairo ḍakottu zola šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Ãra beggune meṛit fori gilamboi. Ar Ibroni bašat ãre hodde ek abaz funni, <char style="wj">'Saul, Saul, tui ãr uwore kiyolla zulum goror? Keṛa buwaiya laṛir mukot lati mariyore ki tui tor nizor hoti no goror ne?' </char><verse eid="ACT 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>"Hetunot ãi fusar goridde, "Malik, õne honnuwa?"<verse eid="ACT 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>"Malike hodde, <char style="wj">'Ãi Isa, zar uwore tui zulum goror. Ehon uṭ, tor ṭengot bor diyore tiya. Šeba goroya edde goba doya hisabe tore loibolla ãi deha diyi, zin tui ãttu deikkos edde zin ãi tore dehaiyum he babute goba dibi.</char> <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/><char style="wj">Tor nizor manuš okkol edde Oihudi okkolor hatottu ãi tore uddar goriyum. Ãi tore hitarar heṛe defeṛair, </char> <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/><char style="wj">hitarar suk kuli dibolla edde andarottu fohorot, edde Šoitanor dokolottu Allar hãse firai anibolla, zene ãr uwore biššaš anonor zoriya hitara guna maf fa edde zarare Paki gora oiye hitarar butore itarar zaga o.'</char><verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>"Etolla badša Agrippa, behostottu ze deha diye ãi hiyanor obaiddo no oi. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Zara Damaskusot ase foila hitarar hãse, tarfore zara Zeruzalemot edde fura Ehudiya elehat ase, hitarar hãse edde tarfore Oihudi okkolor hãse ãi tobolig goijji, ze hitarattu gunattu mon firai Allar mikka firon sa, edde hitarar haz harbare forman fa za ze hitara gunattu mon firaiye. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Etolla Ihudi okkole ãre dórmogóror butore dori marifelaito kušiš goijje. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Kintu Allaye ãre aijja foijjonto modot gori aiyer. Ar hetolla ãi eṛe tiyaiyore šoṛo ḍõr beggunor hãse goba dir. Nobi okkol edde Musaye zin goṭibo hoi giye hinor baire ãi hono kissu no hoir. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>He hota oilde endilla, Mosittu duk šowa foribo edde hiba he foila zon ze morattu zinda uṛi zaiboi, hibar nizor zatir manuš okkolor hãse edde Oihudi okkolor hãse nuror hóbor gušona goribo."<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Paulose endilla gori nizor foikka hota hodde ṭaimot Festuse hoito no diyore guzori hodde, "Paulos, tui fol oi giyosgoi. Tui beši fonna foijjosde hine tore fol banai felaiye."<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Hetunot Paulose hodde: "Ijjotdar Festus, ãi fol no, ãi zin hoir hin soiyi edde lowazade hota. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Badšaye to ei babute zane. Ãi hibar loi kulasa gori har hota hoi fariyum. Ar ãi iyano zani, ze in okkolor hono kissu hibar sukor arguwale no fore, kiyollahoile ei goṭona okkol to gufone no o. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>Badša Agrippa, õne ki nobi okkolor hota biššaš goro? Ãi zani õne goro."<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Hetunot Agrippaye Paulosore hodde, "Tui ki eto baiṭṭa ṭaimot maze ãre Isayi banaibolla kušiš goror?"<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Paulose hodde, "Ṭaim baṛi otóba lamba, ãi šude tũwalla duwa no gorir bolke beggunolla, zara aijja ãr hota fuinne hitara beggune zen ãr ḍoilla o, ei siyolgan sara." <verse eid="ACT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Hetunot badša uiṭṭiye, hitar fũwati govarnar Festus edde Berenik, edde zara hitarar fũwati boiššil hitara beggun uṛi tiyaiye. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Tarfore hitara he górottu giyegoi edde ekzone ekzonore howa hoi šuru goijje,"Ei manušwaye moron šaza ba ziyol haṛibar laikka hono kissu no gore."<verse eid="ACT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Agrippaye Festusore hodde, "Ei manušwaye zodi Romor badšar hãse afil no gorito, toile hitare eridiya zaito."<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Rom šohorot Paulosor baisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Zahazot gori ãrare Itali loi za oibo hiyan zehon faisela gora oiye, Paulos edde aro hoekzon ziyolor hodire Julius name ek ofisaror hatot diya oiye. Julius aššilde Romor badšar nizor soinno dolor ekzon ofisar. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Ãra Adramuttiumottu aiyedde ekkan zahazot uṛi baisa šuru gorilam, ze zahazsan Ešiar bout bondor okkolot zaibo. Ãrar fũwati Makeḍoniya elehar Tessalonika šohoror Arištak o aššil.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Ãrar zahaz tarforor din Sidonot taimme. Juliuse Paulosore beši bondutai dehaiye edde hibare hibar bondu okkolor hãse zaibolla ejazot diye zene Paulosor bondu okkole hibare dorhari zinišfati di fare. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Bade hentu abar ãra zahaz sarilam. Bataš ãrar ulda mikkattu baiye boli ãra Kiprus ḍiyar bataš nu aššilde he mikkattu gilam. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Tarfore ãra Kilikiya edde Famfuliyar sarmottu ze doriya ase, hiyan faraiyore Lukiya elehar Mura šohorot fõsilamboi. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Heṛe ofisarguwaye ekkan zahaz Alekzanderiyattu Itali zadde deha faiyore ãrare he zahazot tuli diye. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Ãrar zahazsan bout din dori aste aste soille, ar beši hošṭo bišṭo gori Knidos šohoror hãsa hãsi fõssi, kintu bataše ãrare ar mummikka zaito no de. Hetunot ãra Kreta ḍiyar ze ḍakottu bataš nu aššil he ḍaikkar Salomona bai sola šuru gorilam. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Doriyar kinaror hãsa hãsa beši hošṭo bišṭo gori solaiyore ãra en ek zagat aišši ziyanore Šundor Bondor boli ho, hiyan oiyede Lasea šohoror ḍake.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Endilla bout din haṛi giyegoi. Hẽtte ruzar din šeš oi zaiyore šithal onumanik aigiyegoi. Hetolla zahazot gori za ekkan ḍõr moškil ham oiye. Hiyanolla buli Paulose zahazor manuš okkolore hũšiyari di hoiye, <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>"So, ãi dekir ãrar ei baisat kub beši hoti oibo. Ei hoti ze šude zahaz edde mal fottror oibo hen to no, bolke ãrar zanor uwore o hoti oibo." <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Kintu ofisare Paulosor hota no funiyore zahazor kepṭin edde zahazor malikor hota fuinne. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Ar bondorgan šit hal haṛaibar laikka zaga no boli, beši bag mainše faisela goijje ze, hentu baisa diyore šombob oile Foniksot zai šit hal haṛa oibo. Foniks aššilde Kreta ḍiyar zahaz tamede zaga. Ei zagagan doin fosim edde uttor fosim ḍakor muk kula aššil.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zór</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Bade zehon doinali bataš halka halka ba šuru goijje, hetunot hitara mone goijje, hitara zen saiye hen faiye, hetolla hitara zahazor nogol tuli loi Kreta ḍiyar hãsa hãsa sola šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Kintu ekka gori bade he ḍiyattu Urakul name ek beši ḍõr tuwan šuru oiye. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Bade zahazsan he tuwanot foijje edde batašolla boli ar ãra mummikka zai no farilam. Toi ãra mummikka zaibar kušiš saridiyore zahazganore bataše baši zaito dilam. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Bade Kaudo name ugguwa šoṛo ḍiya, hibar ze ḍakottu bataš nu aššil he ḍakottu ãra za šuru gorilam. Ar zahazot foran basaibar ze gura no take, hiyan beši duk gori ãra dongšor hatottu basailam. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Manuš okkole nogan zahazor uwore ṭani tuille. Bade dori loi zahazor kúl sai bainde zene hiyanor tottagun aleda oi no zagoi. Syrtis name doriyar sorot zahaz bazi zaiboi ḍore šor nise lamai felaiyore zahazganore bataše solito diye. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Tuwan beši zur onor zoriya ãrar zahazsan endilla ḍula šuru goijje, tarforor din mainše zahazor malfottro okkol felai diya šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Tin dinor din hitara nizor hate zahazor sai samana hãtiyar okkol felai diye. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Bout din dori beil otóba tara kissu deha no za edde beša beši tuwan bat roiye. Šeše ãra foran basai faribar har aša sari dilam.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Manuš okkole bout din dori hono kissu no há boli Paulose hitarar munttu tiyaiyore hodde: "So, ãr hota funiyore Kreta ḍiyattu zahazgan no saron aššil. Hen goitta boli ei mosibot edde dongšor hatottu uddar faita. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Kintu ehon ãi tũwarare foriyad gorir, tũwarar dilot himmot rako, kiyollahoile tũwara honokiye no moriba kintu ei zahazgan dongšo oibo. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Ãi zar manuš edde zar šeba gori, hibar ek firista ãr hãse ai tiyaiyore hoiye, <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>'Paulos, no ḍorais, tottu Romor badšar munttu tiya foribo. Ei zahazot zara tor fũwati zar, hitara beggunor zibonore Allaye doya goriyore tore diye.' <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Etolla tũwarar monot šahoš rako, Allar uwore ãttu ei biššaš ase ze hibaye ãre zen hoiye hen oibo. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Kintu ãrattu hono ugguwa ḍiyat ouzagoi foribo."<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zahaz banga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Ãra Adriya doriya bai en bafe zat takilam, tuwanor soiddo dinor din ada raitta zahazor serainga okkole kulor mikka fõissegai boli ṭaijje. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Ar hitara mafi sadde fani aši hat mur. Ar hotun bade hitara abar mafi sadde heṛe fani haiṭ hat. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Fattoror loi dakka háibo ḍore zahazor fis ḍakottu hitara sairguwa nogol felaiye. Ar hitara dinor fohor oibolla duwa gora šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Bade zahazor serainga okkol dai zaiboilla kušišot zahazor sarmor mikkattu nogol felerfan gori hitara foran basaibar nogan doriyat lamai diye. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Hetunot Paulose ofisar edde šoinno okkolore hodde, "Ei zahazor serainga okkol no takile tũwara rehai no faiba." <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Hetunot šoinno okkole noganor dori haṛi diye, zene hiyan fanit fori zagoi.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Binna oibar age Paulose beggunore kissu háibolla foriyad goijje. "Aijja soiddo din oiye, ki oibo no oibo sinta loi tũwara no hái taikko, hono hána no hó. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Ehon ãi tũwarare kissu háibolla foriyad gorir. Forane basi taibolla tũwarattu kissu há zorulot. Saiyo, tũwarar ekkan matar sul foijjonto luksan no oibo." <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Ei hota hoi Paulose ruṭi loi hitara beggunor sarme Allare šukuriya zanaiye edde hinore bangiyore há šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Hetunot hitara beggune o šahoš faiyore há šuru goijje. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Ãra zahazot moṭ dui šo hoittor sozon aššilam. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Beggune feṭ bori hái bade zahazor uzon homaibolla buli gĩyu okkol doriyat felai diya oiye.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Binna zehon oiye hitara he zagagan sini no fare, kintu en ekkan hári deikke ziyanor ḍake balur sor ase, toi hitara faisela goijje, šombob oile zahazgan he kinare tuli dibo. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Hitara zahazor nogolgunor dori haṛi diyore doriyat felai diye edde suwanir dori o kuli diye. Tarfore hitara boyaror mukor muntu šor ṭakidiye edde kinaror mikka ozi zaiyore sorot bazi giyegoi. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Mummikkar ḍak toratori boizagoinor zoriya zahazsan usol oigiyegoi. Ar fis ḍakottu goiror ḍakkaye ṭura ṭura oi bangi za šuru oiye. <verse eid="ACT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Hetunot šoinno okkole hodi okkolore mari felaibo ereda loiye, zene hitarar butottu honokiye hãsuriyore dai zaigoi no fare. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Kintu ofisare Paulosor foran basaito sail boli šoinno okkolor ereda mozin goitto no de. Hite hokum diye, zara hãsuri fare hitara age zahazottu falmari zai kul suwok. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Ar baki beggune zahazor totta ba oinno hono kissu doriyore heṛe zok. Ebafe beggune šušondane kulot fõisse.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Ãra aramor sãte kul sui fari bade zani farilamde, he ḍiyawar nam Malṭa. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Ar heṛiyar mainše ãrar uwore beša beši doya dehaiye. Hitara ãra beggunore ḍaki loigiye edde oinor ṭal zali diye kiyollahoile hẽtte zór diya šuru goijjil edde ṭanḍa aššil. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Paulose ek ãza fuwana darguwa dola gori oinot furai dibar šomot ugguwa bišwala haf, oinor gorom faiyore he darguwar ṭalor butottu niyoliyore hibar hat sai hõri doijje. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Hafwa Paulosor hatot ḍuli taikkede dekiyore he ḍiyar manuš okkole howahoi gora šuru goijje, "Ei manušwa hameka kuni oibo, kiyollahoile doriyattu rehai oi farile o niyai deviye hitare basito no de." <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Kintu Paulose hat zara mariyore hafware oinot felai diye edde hibar hono hoti no o. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Manuš okkole baffil hibar ga fuli zaiboi, otóba hiba atikka fori mori zaiboi, kintu bout hotun entezar gori bade o zehon hono kissu no o, hen deki hitarar ereda bodolai felaiye edde hodde, iba ek devota.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Heṛe ḍake ekzon Publiyus name he ḍiyar neta aššil. Hite ãrare hitar górot loizaiyore tin din mula beši adoror sãte ãrare mehemandari goijje. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Ar hẽtte Publiyusor bafe zor edde amoša biyaram loi bisanat fori aššil. Ar Paulose butore hitar ḍake zaiyore duwar fũwati hitar uwore hat raikke edde hitare aram goijje. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Ei goṭona bade he ḍiyar baki har biyaraimma okkol o aišše edde aram oiye. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Hitara nanan ḍoilla gori ãrare ijjot dehaiye. Toi zẽtte ãra zahazsan saribolla reḍi oilam, hitara ãrattu zoruloti ziniš fottoro okkol zahazot ani diye.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paulos Rom šohorot fõisse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Tin maš haṛi zaigoi bade ãra ekkan zahazot gori za šuru gorilam ziyane heṛe šit hal haṛail. Ar ei zahazsan aššilde Alekzandriyar, hiyanor matat zoikka devota, Kastor edde Polluxor sinno aššil. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Ãra Sirakušot ailam edde heṛe tin din takilam. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Henttu baisa di ãra Régiumot fõsilam. Tarforor din doinali bataš uiṭṭe ar dusora din ãra Futeoli fõsilam. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Heṛe hoekzon biššaši failam, zitara ãrare hitarar fũwati haftanik takibolla dawat diye. Ei bafe ãra Rom šohorot ailam. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Heṛe torikotor báiboinain okkole ãra aibar hóbor funiyore ãrar loi dola oibolla hoi hitarar kiye kiye Appius bazar edde Tin Šoraihana fara foijjonto aiššil. Ei manuš okkolore dekiyore Paulose Allare šukuriya zanaiye, ar hiba nize o tuwajjo faiye. <verse eid="ACT 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Rom šohorot ãra fõsi bade Paulosore faharadari šoinno okkolor fũwati hibar bote hiba azadi bafe taki faribolla ezajot faiye.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rom šohorot Paulosor tobolig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Tin din bade Paulose heṛiyar Ihudi neta okkol beggunore ḍaki ekkui fũwati dola goijje. Hitara zehon dola oiye Paulose hodde: "Báiyain okkol! Zodi o ãi ãrar zatir berudde kissu no gori, otóba bafdadar dinna solti niyomor ulda kissu no gori, tarfore o ãre ãṭok gora oiye edde Romiyo okkolor hatot diya oiye. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Romiyo okkole ãre zera goriyore bade eridito sail, kiyollahoile moron šazar laikka hono hosuri ãi no gori. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Kintu Ihudi okkole hiyanot baza diye buli ãi Romor badšar hãse afil goijji. Ar iyan o haṭi ze ãi ãr nizor zatir hosuri dehaito aššide no. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Etolla ãi tũwara loi deha goitto edde hota hoito sair. Israili okkolor ekkui ašalla boli ãi siyolor bondi."<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Hitara Paulosore zuwabe hodde, "Ãra tũwar babute Ehudiyattu hono šeṛi no fai, ar ãrar manuš hentu eṛe aiyore o hono hóbor no de otóba tũwar babute hono kissur bura no ho. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Tarfore o ãra tũwar motamot fuinto sai, kiyollahoile ãra beggune zani ze beggune he dolor berudde hota ho."<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Paulos loi dola oibolla hitara ekkan din ṭik goijje edde hitara aro manuš okkol šoho Paulos zeṛe takito heṛe aišše. Hetunot Paulose binnattu loti hazinna ofan foijjonto hitarar hãse goba diye, Allar raijjor babute zanaiye edde buzaiye. Musar Torah edde Nobi okkolor kitab okkolor butottu Isar babute hitarare buzaibolla kušiš goijje. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Paulose hoiyede hin hodune biššaš goijje, ar hodune biššaš no gore. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Paulosor hotat hitara hitara naraz oiye edde hitara hentu giyegoi. Hitara zaibar agottu Paulose hodde, "Pak Ruhuye nobi Esaiyar duwara tũwarar bafdada okkolore hãsa soiyi hoil:<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>"'Manuš okkolor hãse zai ho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">tũwara funat takiba kintu hono bote no buziba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">sat takiba kintu hono bote no zaniba.<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Kiyollahoile ei mainšor dil ošar oigiyegoi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">ar itarar han o bondo oi giyegoi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Ar hitara hitarar suk o bandi raikke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Ar no oile hitara hitarar suke dekito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">hitarar hane funito,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">hitarar dile buzito</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">edde firi aito. Ar ãi hitarare aram goritam.'<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>"Etolla tũwara zani rako ze Allar uddar Oihudi okkolor hãse defeṛa oiye, ar hitara funibo!" <verse eid="ACT 28:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>(Paulose zehon hendilla hoiye, Ihudi okkole tara tara doro biyasana gori gori hentu giyegoi.)<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Fura dui bosormula Paulos heṛe hibar nizor bara górot taikke edde zara hibar loi deha goitto aito, hitara beggunore hibaye gosito. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Hibaye beši šahoš loi hono baza sara Allar raijjor babute šikka dito edde Isa Mosir babute šikka dito.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
